(2894223, 406032, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to this assignment. The stream of beer is just a little too far toward the "model''s" chin, which makes it lose the illusion that the liquid is actually pouring into his mouth. Also, the highlight on the bottle label distracts too much from the product name. Still, you get good points for cleverness.</td>', 'Interesting approach to this assignment. The stream of beer is just a little too far toward the "model''s" chin, which makes it lose the illusion that the liquid is actually pouring into his mouth. Also, the highlight on the bottle label distracts too much from the product name. Still, you get good points for cleverness.', '2006-10-04 02:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894225, 402429, 60195, '<td valign="top">hmmmm...  nice shot.  My guess is that you''ll get knocked for originality.  Last week''s 8th place in "Leading Lines":<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=396136" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/557/thumb/396136.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/557/thumb/396136.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/557/thumb/396136.jpg"/></a></td>', 'hmmmm...  nice shot.  My guess is that you''ll get knocked for originality.  Last week''s 8th place in "Leading Lines":', '2006-10-04 03:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
