(2894729, 405924, 46031, '<td valign="top">I like how the bottles of bacardi and whiskey have just the right amount of blur - they''re clearly in the background, but you can make out what they are. The can isn''t really in focus, though. And it looks like you overdid the post-processing on the whiskey in the glass a little. It looks too unnatural to me.</td>', 'I like how the bottles of bacardi and whiskey have just the right amount of blur - they''re clearly in the background, but you can make out what they are. The can isn''t really in focus, though. And it looks like you overdid the post-processing on the whiskey in the glass a little. It looks too unnatural to me.', '2006-10-04 08:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894736, 402852, 46031, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2006-10-04 08:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894742, 403864, 46031, '<td valign="top">I like the selective DOF, the reflections in the glass are a little irritating (though hard to avoid, I know). Also I think this would''ve worked even better had you used a different color for the background at the end of the table.</td>', 'I like the selective DOF, the reflections in the glass are a little irritating (though hard to avoid, I know). Also I think this would''ve worked even better had you used a different color for the background at the end of the table.', '2006-10-04 08:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894833, 404974, 58247, '<td valign="top">This photo could use better lighting. I''m not a big fan of the background either. But I do like Bass! :-)</td>', 'This photo could use better lighting. I''m not a big fan of the background either. But I do like Bass! :-)', '2006-10-04 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894836, 403864, 58247, '<td valign="top">The white balance is way off here. Perhaps that was done on purpose, but it doesn''t work for me for that reason. Good DOF though.</td>', 'The white balance is way off here. Perhaps that was done on purpose, but it doesn''t work for me for that reason. Good DOF though.', '2006-10-04 08:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894840, 405774, 58247, '<td valign="top">This would be a better shot if the bottle was lit up to show the logo. Not a bad idea though.</td>', 'This would be a better shot if the bottle was lit up to show the logo. Not a bad idea though.', '2006-10-04 08:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2894843, 405959, 58247, '<td valign="top">+1 point for making me laugh with the Title. Red Stripe''s not that bad either. :-)</td>', '+1 point for making me laugh with the Title. Red Stripe''s not that bad either. :-)', '2006-10-04 08:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
