(2895907, 405755, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and attention to detail A green bottle or a different color background would help with product presentation. Comp lends itself very well for text placement.</td>', 'Nice comp and attention to detail A green bottle or a different color background would help with product presentation. Comp lends itself very well for text placement.', '2006-10-04 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
