(2896150, 404026, 52500, '<td valign="top">It''s not beer or a soft drink, but it''s a wonderful photo.  You''ll probably get dinged a bit, but who cares?  This is great.</td>', 'It''s not beer or a soft drink, but it''s a wonderful photo.  You''ll probably get dinged a bit, but who cares?  This is great.', '2006-10-04 15:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896174, 402813, 52500, '<td valign="top">Now this is funny!  Very well done.  By the way, "of" is a preposition, "off" means "not on".  It looks to me like you meant "off".  I''m not counting off for that, of course.  I just like to educate when I can.  (sorry for the info if it was just a typo)</td>', 'Now this is funny!  Very well done.  By the way, "of" is a preposition, "off" means "not on".  It looks to me like you meant "off".  I''m not counting off for that, of course.  I just like to educate when I can.  (sorry for the info if it was just a typo)', '2006-10-04 15:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
