(2896233, 403808, 66631, '<td valign="top">Therere a lot of things I like in this photo...<br/>1stly angle of the bottle perched up in a lemon tree - eye catching &amp; evocative.<br/>2ndly the cider''s association with lemon.<br/>3rdly the white sky background contrasted with the green leaves, dark bark &amp; golden shimmer of the drink.<br/>4thly the close detail of the bark, bottle &amp; lemon.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Therere a lot of things I like in this photo...1stly angle of the bottle perched up in a lemon tree - eye catching & evocative.2ndly the cider''s association with lemon.3rdly the white sky background contrasted with the green leaves, dark bark & golden shimmer of the drink.4thly the close detail of the bark, bottle & lemon.Well done!', '2006-10-04 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
