(2897423, 405818, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice presentaton of product. Dust in carpet and reflection in glass are two avoidable distractions (fill glass more and dust off carpet). Nice comp lends itself well to text placement. Nice job aside from small fixable details.</td>', 'Nice presentaton of product. Dust in carpet and reflection in glass are two avoidable distractions (fill glass more and dust off carpet). Nice comp lends itself well to text placement. Nice job aside from small fixable details.', '2006-10-04 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
