(2897826, 406061, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very subtle. (I don''t know if that''s a good thing in advertising) Nice comp and sharpness as well as nice lighting.I could imagine this photo as an ad with bold text. Your comp allows for creative text placement.8</td>', 'Very subtle. (I don''t know if that''s a good thing in advertising) Nice comp and sharpness as well as nice lighting.I could imagine this photo as an ad with bold text. Your comp allows for creative text placement.8', '2006-10-04 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
