(2897845, 405755, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job. Unfortunatly, I don''t think you will get the brown. I have to give you a 10 just for the most unique idea.</td>', 'Great job. Unfortunatly, I don''t think you will get the brown. I have to give you a 10 just for the most unique idea.', '2006-10-04 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
