(2897867, 405777, 33672, '<td valign="top">Put mine on the rocks and hold the soda. Nice display of single malts. I like the set up and there''s some potential here for an effective ad. I guess its needs more contrast as to show the labels more prevelantly. Perhaps a tighter crop or a wider angle lens.  Perhaps remon=ving the canisters to make it less cluttered. B&amp;w and still life mode works well especially for something as classic as single malt scotchs.</td>', 'Put mine on the rocks and hold the soda. Nice display of single malts. I like the set up and there''s some potential here for an effective ad. I guess its needs more contrast as to show the labels more prevelantly. Perhaps a tighter crop or a wider angle lens.  Perhaps remon=ving the canisters to make it less cluttered. B&w and still life mode works well especially for something as classic as single malt scotchs.', '2006-10-04 22:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897887, 406055, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to this. Altering and/or riding a popular theme is a good idea. The milk cartton is distracting but I wonder if that was intentional to play on the "got milk" Campaign. Dof is nice but comp needs to be a bit more off centered to let creativity flow with the text placement.</td>', 'Nice approach to this. Altering and/or riding a popular theme is a good idea. The milk cartton is distracting but I wonder if that was intentional to play on the "got milk" Campaign. Dof is nice but comp needs to be a bit more off centered to let creativity flow with the text placement.', '2006-10-04 22:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
