(2898543, 404639, 51793, '<td valign="top">Okay I have a few problems with this picture, <br/> <br/>You''re title says "Get dirty with a bud light" and the truck is dirty but she is not. So she really didn''t get dirty did she? Also, the old t-shirt in the back of the truck really doesn''t fit the picture either. <br/>Another thing is the bracelet that she has on. Jewelry stands for fashion or class and I think that the look that you were looking for was more country. If not then you wouldn''t have used the old ford. And the last thing is... Her pants are so high up that it really looks kind of funny. I mean she is in a swimsuit top and she has pants on that could literally cover her chest. But that is just my opinion.</td>', 'Okay I have a few problems with this picture,  You''re title says "Get dirty with a bud light" and the truck is dirty but she is not. So she really didn''t get dirty did she? Also, the old t-shirt in the back of the truck really doesn''t fit the picture either. Another thing is the bracelet that she has on. Jewelry stands for fashion or class and I think that the look that you were looking for was more country. If not then you wouldn''t have used the old ford. And the last thing is... Her pants are so high up that it really looks kind of funny. I mean she is in a swimsuit top and she has pants on that could literally cover her chest. But that is just my opinion.', '2006-10-05 02:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2898547, 405635, 51793, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here in this picture I think. <br/>You also have keys in the picture too. Are you trying to promote drinking and driving? [3]</td>', 'Too much going on here in this picture I think. You also have keys in the picture too. Are you trying to promote drinking and driving? [3]', '2006-10-05 02:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
