(2898556, 405833, 51793, '<td valign="top">The word pepper is out of focus something around the "pep" and the est.1885 is also not that clear. The background is a little confusing but that could be that you have too much can and not enough background to even it out. <br/>Try to back up off the can to get a better more clear image. If you want to take a close up, zoom in. when you get too close you lose clarity.</td>', 'The word pepper is out of focus something around the "pep" and the est.1885 is also not that clear. The background is a little confusing but that could be that you have too much can and not enough background to even it out. Try to back up off the can to get a better more clear image. If you want to take a close up, zoom in. when you get too close you lose clarity.', '2006-10-05 02:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
