(2899563, 403112, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is he supposed to be passed out or is he lapping the beer off the table?  If passed out he''d be more relaxed (arm not supporting), if lapping you might see his tongue.  Bet you had fun cleaning up the mess afterwards.  ;)  The lighting on this is a bit harsh (strong glare on the glass and can).</td>', 'Is he supposed to be passed out or is he lapping the beer off the table?  If passed out he''d be more relaxed (arm not supporting), if lapping you might see his tongue.  Bet you had fun cleaning up the mess afterwards.  ;)  The lighting on this is a bit harsh (strong glare on the glass and can).', '2006-10-05 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899566, 404388, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple...looks refreshing, although not much of it looks well focused.  I think the focal point is underwater, making it comes out softer?  Hmmm...just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clean, simple...looks refreshing, although not much of it looks well focused.  I think the focal point is underwater, making it comes out softer?  Hmmm...just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-05 11:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899570, 405474, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beer?  Soft Drink?  Sorry, not getting the connection to the challenge here.  Looks like maybe it was intended for ''High Contrast''?</td>', 'Beer?  Soft Drink?  Sorry, not getting the connection to the challenge here.  Looks like maybe it was intended for ''High Contrast''?', '2006-10-05 11:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899582, 405196, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the color reflection on the background.  The seam where the background materials meet is distracting (and totally avoidable).  Lighting is a little strong and generating some glare.  Might have had more impact if the entire bottle was visible.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the color reflection on the background.  The seam where the background materials meet is distracting (and totally avoidable).  Lighting is a little strong and generating some glare.  Might have had more impact if the entire bottle was visible.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-05 11:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899585, 403000, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever and very SaaaWEET!  :D  Nicely done.  Congrats on your ribbon in advance.</td>', 'Clever and very SaaaWEET!  :D  Nicely done.  Congrats on your ribbon in advance.', '2006-10-05 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899589, 404974, 30049, '<td valign="top">A well thought out composition.  Need some fill light reflected back into the lower areas to brighten this up some.</td>', 'A well thought out composition.  Need some fill light reflected back into the lower areas to brighten this up some.', '2006-10-05 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899592, 405609, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "OK".  The background color is too similar IMO.  White or even red could have given this a boost.  As is, it feels a little drab.</td>', 'It''s "OK".  The background color is too similar IMO.  White or even red could have given this a boost.  As is, it feels a little drab.', '2006-10-05 12:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899593, 405812, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, however nothing is in focus here.</td>', 'Clever idea, however nothing is in focus here.', '2006-10-05 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899597, 404484, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful execution of the image capture with the splash, lighting, etc...  It''s the attention to details that gets you here with scoring.  The background seam is distracting (and avoidable).  Wait, unless this is in a tub or something?  Hmmm.  Well, whatever the background is, it BEGS to be white instead of grey.</td>', 'Wonderful execution of the image capture with the splash, lighting, etc...  It''s the attention to details that gets you here with scoring.  The background seam is distracting (and avoidable).  Wait, unless this is in a tub or something?  Hmmm.  Well, whatever the background is, it BEGS to be white instead of grey.', '2006-10-05 12:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899600, 405768, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute bottle, but where is the artistry in the photo?  It''s kind of static.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a cute bottle, but where is the artistry in the photo?  It''s kind of static.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-05 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899604, 402852, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  I''ve heard someone mention Jones soda before...isn''t it a local/regional item?  Anyway...very cool choice/setup for your photo here.  Good choice of shutter speed to freeze some of the water spray.  I do wish the composition wasn''t quite so tight...little more room to the outside of each bottle might make this stronger.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey.  I''ve heard someone mention Jones soda before...isn''t it a local/regional item?  Anyway...very cool choice/setup for your photo here.  Good choice of shutter speed to freeze some of the water spray.  I do wish the composition wasn''t quite so tight...little more room to the outside of each bottle might make this stronger.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899621, 405321, 30049, '<td valign="top">A what?!  :D  Nice colors.  Could have called this a smoothie with all the NI (noise reduction) applied here.  He-he.</td>', 'A what?!  :D  Nice colors.  Could have called this a smoothie with all the NI (noise reduction) applied here.  He-he.', '2006-10-05 12:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899624, 404048, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV.  Focus seems off some here and the lighting is in need of a boost.  Reflector off to lower right would have helped.</td>', 'Interesting POV.  Focus seems off some here and the lighting is in need of a boost.  Reflector off to lower right would have helped.', '2006-10-05 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899627, 405126, 30049, '<td valign="top">Your sky is blown out.  Waterfall is too blue.  Oh, wait...that''s only a backdrop isn''t it.  I don''t know, when I think of IceWater I usually think of it being clear and crisp.  With the way you''ve positioned this bottle and the backdrop used, the water appears yellow.  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your sky is blown out.  Waterfall is too blue.  Oh, wait...that''s only a backdrop isn''t it.  I don''t know, when I think of IceWater I usually think of it being clear and crisp.  With the way you''ve positioned this bottle and the backdrop used, the water appears yellow.  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-05 12:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899630, 404381, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  Great lighting. Cool effect with the water spray.  Well done.</td>', 'Well composed.  Great lighting. Cool effect with the water spray.  Well done.', '2006-10-05 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1);
