(2900189, 404788, 53959, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition.  I could easily see this on the side of a bus, or in a magazine.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition.  I could easily see this on the side of a bus, or in a magazine.', '2006-10-05 16:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900203, 405774, 65779, '<td valign="top">Can''t see the label, so not very good as an advert.</td>', 'Can''t see the label, so not very good as an advert.', '2006-10-05 16:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900212, 406054, 65779, '<td valign="top">Satisfying image - very good</td>', 'Satisfying image - very good', '2006-10-05 16:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900227, 405584, 65779, '<td valign="top">I like the stylish retro feel.  I would have put the first bottle in focus though.</td>', 'I like the stylish retro feel.  I would have put the first bottle in focus though.', '2006-10-05 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900229, 405214, 65779, '<td valign="top">Dunno what the product is but it is a great pic</td>', 'Dunno what the product is but it is a great pic', '2006-10-05 16:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900264, 405607, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Comp is a little too centered but a taller crop would allow space for text underneath the bottle. A little condensation would help add a "refreshing" touch in contrast to the warm colors you use for the background. Also a bit more contrast betwen the product and the background would help.</td>', 'Nice job. Comp is a little too centered but a taller crop would allow space for text underneath the bottle. A little condensation would help add a "refreshing" touch in contrast to the warm colors you use for the background. Also a bit more contrast betwen the product and the background would help.', '2006-10-05 16:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900267, 405635, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice pour thats a bit too cluttered. A cleared table by either removing the objects or a shallow DOF would''ve improved this immensely.</td>', 'Nice pour thats a bit too cluttered. A cleared table by either removing the objects or a shallow DOF would''ve improved this immensely.', '2006-10-05 16:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900272, 402813, 33672, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. Nice lighting. A larger crop would''ve facilitated text placement. Moving the product closer would''ve been ideal too.</td>', 'Funny idea. Nice lighting. A larger crop would''ve facilitated text placement. Moving the product closer would''ve been ideal too.', '2006-10-05 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900276, 404484, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. This "action" Photo is perfect for this product. Catchy tag line too. Needs a little more contrast to really pop out at the viewer.</td>', 'Nice capture. This "action" Photo is perfect for this product. Catchy tag line too. Needs a little more contrast to really pop out at the viewer.', '2006-10-05 16:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900279, 403870, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun to look at image, but the title is the only connection to the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun to look at image, but the title is the only connection to the challenge.', '2006-10-05 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900284, 406004, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops.  It''s a little blurry.  :(</td>', 'Oops.  It''s a little blurry.  :(', '2006-10-05 16:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900289, 405241, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok...this works.  Decent composition - catchy phrase in the title to hookup with the image.  Technicals are fine.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok...this works.  Decent composition - catchy phrase in the title to hookup with the image.  Technicals are fine.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-05 16:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900341, 405003, 66192, '<td valign="top">This Photo Rocks!</td>', 'This Photo Rocks!', '2006-10-05 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900351, 404484, 65779, '<td valign="top">Background lacks interest for me but not bad effect otherwise.</td>', 'Background lacks interest for me but not bad effect otherwise.', '2006-10-05 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900383, 403067, 47020, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this photo... frosted bottle, with just the logo wiped away.  It could work well being worked into a 15 second TV spot or something, even -- maybe someone gets the beer out of the freezer, whipes off the logo to make sure they''re getting the right bottle, pops the top, chugs it (or pours it out into a glass), and then sets down the empty, still frosted, logo showing.  Or something like that... could be quite compelling, I think.  (And I don''t even drink beer.  ;-)<br/> <br/>As for the photo, though, I think there''s a lot of room for improvement.  I find there''s too much going on in the background -- it''s all blury and indistinct, but it''s still busy enough to be distracting.  I also think a nice single directed light source type situation might work well for this... somewhat hard, but somewhat soft too -- like maybe close to a table lamp or something, where it would make bright highlights and dark shadows.  As it is, it''s a bit dull looking.  Also, it''d be nice if you''d grabbed the bottle by the bottom or top only, and not at the level that was going to be in the shot, so all the ice would be intact, except for the logo.<br/> <br/>I''m thinking I can''t rate the photo all that highly, but I liked the idea enough that I wanted to let you know my thoughts.</td>', 'I really like the concept of this photo... frosted bottle, with just the logo wiped away.  It could work well being worked into a 15 second TV spot or something, even -- maybe someone gets the beer out of the freezer, whipes off the logo to make sure they''re getting the right bottle, pops the top, chugs it (or pours it out into a glass), and then sets down the empty, still frosted, logo showing.  Or something like that... could be quite compelling, I think.  (And I don''t even drink beer.  ;-) As for the photo, though, I think there''s a lot of room for improvement.  I find there''s too much going on in the background -- it''s all blury and indistinct, but it''s still busy enough to be distracting.  I also think a nice single directed light source type situation might work well for this... somewhat hard, but somewhat soft too -- like maybe close to a table lamp or something, where it would make bright highlights and dark shadows.  As it is, it''s a bit dull looking.  Also, it''d be nice if you''d grabbed the bottle by the bottom or top only, and not at the level that was going to be in the shot, so all the ice would be intact, except for the logo. I''m thinking I can''t rate the photo all that highly, but I liked the idea enough that I wanted to let you know my thoughts.', '2006-10-05 17:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900392, 402852, 47020, '<td valign="top">You should submit this photo to Jones Soda Co. for possible inclusion on one of their labels.  :-)<br/> <br/>I really like the idea.  The execution leaves me wanting a little bit more, but alas, I''m not sure I can put a finger on why.    Perhaps the bottles are just a little too far out to the edge of the frame for my tastes??<br/> <br/>Anyway, pretty good job.  And I commend you for the effort -- I''m guessing you got wet for this one!  :-)</td>', 'You should submit this photo to Jones Soda Co. for possible inclusion on one of their labels.  :-) I really like the idea.  The execution leaves me wanting a little bit more, but alas, I''m not sure I can put a finger on why.    Perhaps the bottles are just a little too far out to the edge of the frame for my tastes?? Anyway, pretty good job.  And I commend you for the effort -- I''m guessing you got wet for this one!  :-)', '2006-10-05 17:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900425, 403472, 47020, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this might look a lot better on a darker screen than mine...  it does seem that there''s just a bit of detail in the bright whites, but I think it would look a lot better if there was more range there.</td>', 'I''m guessing this might look a lot better on a darker screen than mine...  it does seem that there''s just a bit of detail in the bright whites, but I think it would look a lot better if there was more range there.', '2006-10-05 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900450, 405420, 47020, '<td valign="top">Ingenious notion.  Fun shot.</td>', 'Ingenious notion.  Fun shot.', '2006-10-05 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900528, 405895, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: Good idea.  The "lite" bottle seems not vertical which detracts a little.  I''d like to see more of the other bottles to emphasize the "rising up" concept.</td>', '7: Good idea.  The "lite" bottle seems not vertical which detracts a little.  I''d like to see more of the other bottles to emphasize the "rising up" concept.', '2006-10-05 18:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900530, 404232, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: The comparison idea is good.  The shot just seems a little flat and the reflections in the empty bottle are a bit harsh - do you have a polarising filter?</td>', '5: The comparison idea is good.  The shot just seems a little flat and the reflections in the empty bottle are a bit harsh - do you have a polarising filter?', '2006-10-05 18:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900538, 405951, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: Good idea but I''m not sure all the voters are going to notice the "reflection" is different from the can.  The colours also seem a bit flat for DPC :(<br/> <br/>I think the idea is nicely unique and the can is sharply in focus as the top but lacks "wow"</td>', '7: Good idea but I''m not sure all the voters are going to notice the "reflection" is different from the can.  The colours also seem a bit flat for DPC :( I think the idea is nicely unique and the can is sharply in focus as the top but lacks "wow"', '2006-10-05 18:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900542, 403411, 25742, '<td valign="top">yes, it''s called beer! :)<br/>good lighting. for some reason the bottle seems to be leaning a little bit left and forward.<br/>should be in top 5</td>', 'yes, it''s called beer! :)good lighting. for some reason the bottle seems to be leaning a little bit left and forward.should be in top 5', '2006-10-05 18:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900546, 404812, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Wonderful concept - you were at the right place at the right time.  I can see that capturing this shot would have been hard but there are a few things you could have done to make this better: crop a bit tighter and level the floor to start with.</td>', '6: Wonderful concept - you were at the right place at the right time.  I can see that capturing this shot would have been hard but there are a few things you could have done to make this better: crop a bit tighter and level the floor to start with.', '2006-10-05 18:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900584, 405976, 15711, '<td valign="top">Muy bien! I like the closeness and excellent colors.</td>', 'Muy bien! I like the closeness and excellent colors.', '2006-10-05 18:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900607, 405781, 61818, '<td valign="top">This would have look 100% better without the beer spilling over.  Or, while a much tougher shot, getting the foam of the beer as it is just coming down the edge a bit.  The mess on the bottom is distracting.  Doesn''t make me want to grab a beer, makes me want to grab some paper towels.  Lighting is nice in how it makes the beer glow gold.  Would like to see the white foam on top as well (spot light from above?).  Good luck.</td>', 'This would have look 100% better without the beer spilling over.  Or, while a much tougher shot, getting the foam of the beer as it is just coming down the edge a bit.  The mess on the bottom is distracting.  Doesn''t make me want to grab a beer, makes me want to grab some paper towels.  Lighting is nice in how it makes the beer glow gold.  Would like to see the white foam on top as well (spot light from above?).  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900611, 403112, 61818, '<td valign="top">Funny in a college sort of way (anyone drink this swill after college? heheh).  Flash lighting is pretty harsh, whole photo is tilted to the right.  This defintely doesn''t cut it as an advertisement.  Good luck.</td>', 'Funny in a college sort of way (anyone drink this swill after college? heheh).  Flash lighting is pretty harsh, whole photo is tilted to the right.  This defintely doesn''t cut it as an advertisement.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900612, 405281, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the color and focus are great, not sure I like the can placement on the steering wheel but still a nice image. 6</td>', 'I love the idea and the color and focus are great, not sure I like the can placement on the steering wheel but still a nice image. 6', '2006-10-05 18:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900616, 405438, 61818, '<td valign="top">On the one hand, this is a pretty lame ad concept.  On the other hand, you''ve presented it like an ad which is great.  The photo is well taken, and I could see this sort of thing being in a magazine with a little work.  Nice job, good luck.</td>', 'On the one hand, this is a pretty lame ad concept.  On the other hand, you''ve presented it like an ad which is great.  The photo is well taken, and I could see this sort of thing being in a magazine with a little work.  Nice job, good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900618, 402535, 61818, '<td valign="top">Should be a girl in a bikini in this picture.  You don''t sell beer by showing a mostly empty beach.  You sell beer by showing healthy, sexy people frolicking on the beach.  Nontheless, this would work a lot better if the beer itself were standing straight up.  Perhaps you''d been drinking it before taking the shot, eh?  Admit it!</td>', 'Should be a girl in a bikini in this picture.  You don''t sell beer by showing a mostly empty beach.  You sell beer by showing healthy, sexy people frolicking on the beach.  Nontheless, this would work a lot better if the beer itself were standing straight up.  Perhaps you''d been drinking it before taking the shot, eh?  Admit it!', '2006-10-05 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900619, 404372, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: A good shot but a bit blown out at the top.  If this was deliberate then I dont think it works as it pulls my attention to the top of the glass and the OOF beer being poured whereas the logo seems to be the main point of this image the way it is</td>', '6: A good shot but a bit blown out at the top.  If this was deliberate then I dont think it works as it pulls my attention to the top of the glass and the OOF beer being poured whereas the logo seems to be the main point of this image the way it is', '2006-10-05 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900621, 405783, 61818, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad ad shot.  The lighting could be a little moodier, and I think you could have pulled that off in post-processing by playing with levels/curves.  One thing about advertisements is they generally show a brand of some sort which  you are being convinced to buy.  That seems to be missing here.  All in all not bad.  Good luck.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad ad shot.  The lighting could be a little moodier, and I think you could have pulled that off in post-processing by playing with levels/curves.  One thing about advertisements is they generally show a brand of some sort which  you are being convinced to buy.  That seems to be missing here.  All in all not bad.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900624, 405514, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''m probably the 10th person to leave you this comment, but here it is anyway: the bottle is too dark.  Maybe that''s the idea or something.  Composition here is in dire need of improvement.  Also, use Save for Web and submit your image at the max allowed size.  The lighting in this shot is actually pretty nice.  If the picture were a decent size and you had something like a pocket flash light aimed at the label of the bottle, you''d actually have a decent advertisement looking image here.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m probably the 10th person to leave you this comment, but here it is anyway: the bottle is too dark.  Maybe that''s the idea or something.  Composition here is in dire need of improvement.  Also, use Save for Web and submit your image at the max allowed size.  The lighting in this shot is actually pretty nice.  If the picture were a decent size and you had something like a pocket flash light aimed at the label of the bottle, you''d actually have a decent advertisement looking image here.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900632, 405774, 61818, '<td valign="top">Tough shot, trying to display the bottle while not blowing out the sky.  Should have used a refelector of some sort to bounce some light back onto that label because it is just about too dark to read - not a good thing for an advertisement.  Idea here is nice, composition is good.  Good luck.</td>', 'Tough shot, trying to display the bottle while not blowing out the sky.  Should have used a refelector of some sort to bounce some light back onto that label because it is just about too dark to read - not a good thing for an advertisement.  Idea here is nice, composition is good.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900636, 403112, 60495, '<td valign="top">Now thats funny!</td>', 'Now thats funny!', '2006-10-05 18:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900638, 404699, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this works as an ad.  8 cans of the competition and 1 of your won eh?  Setting that aside, the Pepsi label should be displayed in full (if you''re making a Pepsi ad here).  Composition would work better if cropped so there was no whitespace on the left side.  DoF is nice though getting ALL the coke blurred out would have been even better.  Overall not bad, good luck.</td>', 'Not sure how this works as an ad.  8 cans of the competition and 1 of your won eh?  Setting that aside, the Pepsi label should be displayed in full (if you''re making a Pepsi ad here).  Composition would work better if cropped so there was no whitespace on the left side.  DoF is nice though getting ALL the coke blurred out would have been even better.  Overall not bad, good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900641, 405781, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I love the glow from the beer. 8</td>', 'Great lighting, I love the glow from the beer. 8', '2006-10-05 19:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900642, 405096, 61818, '<td valign="top">What is this, bottled LSD?  Composition is nice, the idea and background are equally bizarre.  I think a label of some sort would have cemented the advertisement idea better.  This really just comes across as some sort of bizzare bottle abstract.  Good luck.</td>', 'What is this, bottled LSD?  Composition is nice, the idea and background are equally bizarre.  I think a label of some sort would have cemented the advertisement idea better.  This really just comes across as some sort of bizzare bottle abstract.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900643, 405920, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, well composed.  13% through voting and this is the first photo I''ve come across that acctually looks like an ad.  I''m thirsty now.  You''ve succeeded.</td>', 'Nicely lit, well composed.  13% through voting and this is the first photo I''ve come across that acctually looks like an ad.  I''m thirsty now.  You''ve succeeded.', '2006-10-05 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900646, 405818, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  Focus should have been on the big label though.  It''s blurred enough to be a distraction when it should be the highlight of the image.  Reflections on the top of the glass should go (black sheet behind you?)  Good job.</td>', 'Not bad.  Focus should have been on the big label though.  It''s blurred enough to be a distraction when it should be the highlight of the image.  Reflections on the top of the glass should go (black sheet behind you?)  Good job.', '2006-10-05 19:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900649, 404484, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: Great capture.  Nice and crisp focus. The only faults I can find are the reflection on the bottle and the fact the bottle is not vertical.</td>', '7: Great capture.  Nice and crisp focus. The only faults I can find are the reflection on the bottle and the fact the bottle is not vertical.', '2006-10-05 19:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900652, 405312, 61818, '<td valign="top">Too sexy for your can so you spit on the can?  What is that?  This idea isn''t bad, and if the Dr Pepper logo were fully in the frame it would make a decent advertisement.  Is the blue stuff at the bottom foam?  Blue foam is probably not going to sell much Dr Pepper...  Might have a whitebalance issue there.  Good luck.</td>', 'Too sexy for your can so you spit on the can?  What is that?  This idea isn''t bad, and if the Dr Pepper logo were fully in the frame it would make a decent advertisement.  Is the blue stuff at the bottom foam?  Blue foam is probably not going to sell much Dr Pepper...  Might have a whitebalance issue there.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900657, 406059, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The negative space at the top doesn''t enhance this shot.  Cropped landscape would let the eye get more of that nice gradient at the bottom and add some negative space on the sides of the glass where it is needed.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The negative space at the top doesn''t enhance this shot.  Cropped landscape would let the eye get more of that nice gradient at the bottom and add some negative space on the sides of the glass where it is needed.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900661, 402728, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed.  I could see this as an ad for Coke.  Only bad thing here is the background.  Lot of oddball colors there, even though out of focus, that pull the eye away from the thing you are trying to sell.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed.  I could see this as an ad for Coke.  Only bad thing here is the background.  Lot of oddball colors there, even though out of focus, that pull the eye away from the thing you are trying to sell.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900664, 406013, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: Nothing seems to be in crisp focus to fraw my attention</td>', '5: Nothing seems to be in crisp focus to fraw my attention', '2006-10-05 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900665, 404372, 61818, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good concept.  Lighting needs work and it looks like the top of the glass is overexposed or damn close.  A darker background would help as would increasing the contrast overall via levels or curves.  Not too shabby.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good composition, good concept.  Lighting needs work and it looks like the top of the glass is overexposed or damn close.  A darker background would help as would increasing the contrast overall via levels or curves.  Not too shabby.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900669, 404639, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Well, sex does sell and the beer companies do use so so why not?  A tighter crop on the girl and beer and less greenery perhaps?</td>', '6: Well, sex does sell and the beer companies do use so so why not?  A tighter crop on the girl and beer and less greenery perhaps?', '2006-10-05 19:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900670, 405196, 61818, '<td valign="top">Got a feeling that cutting off part of the product is a pretty big no-no in advertising.  Seam at the bottom of your background is trouble.  Also not sure about the silver label and the white background.  I do like the color behind the bottle, but I think a darker background would have worked better even if it meant losing that color.  Good luck.</td>', 'Got a feeling that cutting off part of the product is a pretty big no-no in advertising.  Seam at the bottom of your background is trouble.  Also not sure about the silver label and the white background.  I do like the color behind the bottle, but I think a darker background would have worked better even if it meant losing that color.  Good luck.', '2006-10-05 19:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900674, 406032, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Funny but there is a clear distinction between the bottle/beer and GW which gives the feel of a compsite rather than a "real" photo</td>', '6: Funny but there is a clear distinction between the bottle/beer and GW which gives the feel of a compsite rather than a "real" photo', '2006-10-05 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900685, 405812, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: I love the idea but the OOF look doesnt work for me :(</td>', '5: I love the idea but the OOF look doesnt work for me :(', '2006-10-05 19:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900686, 405514, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: Good idea and the moddy lighting and brick background is good.  I think you may have had trouble with the lighting in the room but the way it is doesnt work for me.  I feel that something should be sharp (the bottle?) but nothing is.</td>', '5: Good idea and the moddy lighting and brick background is good.  I think you may have had trouble with the lighting in the room but the way it is doesnt work for me.  I feel that something should be sharp (the bottle?) but nothing is.', '2006-10-05 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900689, 405777, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: Hmmm, can I pop around for a drink sometime?  What a collection!  I like the B&amp;W treatment and the symmetry with the heights.  The flash feels out of place though.</td>', '7: Hmmm, can I pop around for a drink sometime?  What a collection!  I like the B&W treatment and the symmetry with the heights.  The flash feels out of place though.', '2006-10-05 19:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900701, 405755, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: It''s not a very strong beer is it? Perhaps the 3.9 is the score for the brown?  Very clever idea and I like the upset phtographer in the background.</td>', '7: It''s not a very strong beer is it? Perhaps the 3.9 is the score for the brown?  Very clever idea and I like the upset phtographer in the background.', '2006-10-05 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900708, 402429, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: Great idea and well executed.  I''d have cropped it at the left to not show the bottles ending but to give the idea of going on forever.</td>', '7: Great idea and well executed.  I''d have cropped it at the left to not show the bottles ending but to give the idea of going on forever.', '2006-10-05 19:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900710, 405457, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I can imagine how many takes this took. Lighting is a bit harsh but probably could be corrected with a white balance adjustment.?.?<br/>Off centered comp is interesting and would work well with text.</td>', 'Nice capture. I can imagine how many takes this took. Lighting is a bit harsh but probably could be corrected with a white balance adjustment.?.?Off centered comp is interesting and would work well with text.', '2006-10-05 19:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900716, 403163, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and comp. Funny. Looks at least like it was a fun shoot. Maybe would work as an ad for coke;)</td>', 'Nice photo and comp. Funny. Looks at least like it was a fun shoot. Maybe would work as an ad for coke;)', '2006-10-05 19:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900717, 404902, 47541, '<td valign="top">8: What a nice shot.  I like the fact that the cap seems to be the major item but the reflection of the bottle gives an interest to the rest of the image</td>', '8: What a nice shot.  I like the fact that the cap seems to be the major item but the reflection of the bottle gives an interest to the rest of the image', '2006-10-05 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900725, 402535, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Oh no, the bottle is falling!  A bit of rotation to straighten the bottle would help.  I like the way the pier in the background runs off into the distance.</td>', '6: Oh no, the bottle is falling!  A bit of rotation to straighten the bottle would help.  I like the way the pier in the background runs off into the distance.', '2006-10-05 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
