(2901177, 405783, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: This is a good shot for an add.  The lights in the background draw attention away from the beer.</td>', '6: This is a good shot for an add.  The lights in the background draw attention away from the beer.', '2006-10-05 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
