(2902080, 405628, 51112, '<td valign="top">I think the bottle on the left should have been in focus, as it''s the strongest part in the composition, my eye is drawn to it but when I look it''s blurry. I''m not sure about the highlights as well, they look as if coming from a head-on flash, they''re too strong.</td>', 'I think the bottle on the left should have been in focus, as it''s the strongest part in the composition, my eye is drawn to it but when I look it''s blurry. I''m not sure about the highlights as well, they look as if coming from a head-on flash, they''re too strong.', '2006-10-06 05:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902086, 405126, 51112, '<td valign="top">Looks like held in front of a monitor or something, the bottle does not match the background (which is anyway kinda blown-out). A better background &amp; better blending would have made a lot of difference.</td>', 'Looks like held in front of a monitor or something, the bottle does not match the background (which is anyway kinda blown-out). A better background & better blending would have made a lot of difference.', '2006-10-06 06:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902103, 405812, 51112, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, it''s different but a bit blurry. Also maybe showing a little more of the can would give a better feeling of being inside the can.</td>', 'I like the idea, it''s different but a bit blurry. Also maybe showing a little more of the can would give a better feeling of being inside the can.', '2006-10-06 06:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902112, 405246, 51112, '<td valign="top">It''s hard finding the subject of the photo, composition-wise. You have the bottle and the cigar pointing at the glass, but the glass itself is small &amp; dull, lacking in detail. Maybe a tighter crop with more emphasis on the glass would help.</td>', 'It''s hard finding the subject of the photo, composition-wise. You have the bottle and the cigar pointing at the glass, but the glass itself is small & dull, lacking in detail. Maybe a tighter crop with more emphasis on the glass would help.', '2006-10-06 06:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902113, 404974, 51112, '<td valign="top">A bit too much background in focus, it''s distracting. Also the idea is too close to the challenge title, a little more than showing a bottle is needed here.</td>', 'A bit too much background in focus, it''s distracting. Also the idea is too close to the challenge title, a little more than showing a bottle is needed here.', '2006-10-06 06:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902115, 406058, 51112, '<td valign="top">Not really cold &amp; refreshing as the composition goes. Hard, yes! :-D lol</td>', 'Not really cold & refreshing as the composition goes. Hard, yes! :-D lol', '2006-10-06 06:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902116, 405191, 51653, '<td valign="top">I found it too soft. <br/>The environment is also not really a good one for an advertisement.</td>', 'I found it too soft. The environment is also not really a good one for an advertisement.', '2006-10-06 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902117, 404954, 51653, '<td valign="top">I cannot figure out how this can be used for an advertisement.</td>', 'I cannot figure out how this can be used for an advertisement.', '2006-10-06 06:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902118, 405514, 51653, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark</td>', 'A bit too dark', '2006-10-06 06:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902121, 405953, 51653, '<td valign="top">It does not inspire me to buy this drink!</td>', 'It does not inspire me to buy this drink!', '2006-10-06 06:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902122, 403067, 51653, '<td valign="top">I cannot really figure out how this can be used as an advertisement.<br/>The main point here is that the sensation is not of a cold drink: it seems more dirty or painted than covered with ice.</td>', 'I cannot really figure out how this can be used as an advertisement.The main point here is that the sensation is not of a cold drink: it seems more dirty or painted than covered with ice.', '2006-10-06 06:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902123, 406052, 51112, '<td valign="top">mmmm i can almost taste it, it''s refreshing and fruity (does that exist?) :-). Would really work for an ad. And it''s different fromt the other entries.</td>', 'mmmm i can almost taste it, it''s refreshing and fruity (does that exist?) :-). Would really work for an ad. And it''s different fromt the other entries.', '2006-10-06 06:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902124, 405096, 51653, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract, but I find it too confused for an advertisement</td>', 'An interesting abstract, but I find it too confused for an advertisement', '2006-10-06 06:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902125, 405196, 51653, '<td valign="top">I think this could be really enanched by a different crop, to include the whole bottle.</td>', 'I think this could be really enanched by a different crop, to include the whole bottle.', '2006-10-06 06:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902128, 406061, 51653, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could be improved by a different white balance. The beer is not very attractive like it is.</td>', 'I think this shot could be improved by a different white balance. The beer is not very attractive like it is.', '2006-10-06 06:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902130, 402740, 51653, '<td valign="top">I cannot really understand how this meet the challenge.</td>', 'I cannot really understand how this meet the challenge.', '2006-10-06 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902133, 405703, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I do not really like the "sciarpa rossa" effect. It could be an interesting and well executed shot without it.</td>', 'I''m afraid I do not really like the "sciarpa rossa" effect. It could be an interesting and well executed shot without it.', '2006-10-06 06:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902134, 404103, 51653, '<td valign="top">I find it a bit too dark</td>', 'I find it a bit too dark', '2006-10-06 06:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902135, 405812, 51653, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but it is really too soft and I miss the drink coming out!</td>', 'A nice idea, but it is really too soft and I miss the drink coming out!', '2006-10-06 06:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902136, 405777, 51653, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the light you used, but I''m finding hard considering whiskey a soft drink.</td>', 'I like the shot and the light you used, but I''m finding hard considering whiskey a soft drink.', '2006-10-06 06:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902138, 404902, 51653, '<td valign="top">It does not really inspires me to have beer.</td>', 'It does not really inspires me to have beer.', '2006-10-06 06:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902141, 405988, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I find the background quite confusing.</td>', 'I''m afraid I find the background quite confusing.', '2006-10-06 06:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902142, 406059, 51653, '<td valign="top">I would like a bit more space below</td>', 'I would like a bit more space below', '2006-10-06 06:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902413, 405176, 58247, '<td valign="top">Good job. Looks exactly like something you''d see in a real advertisement.</td>', 'Good job. Looks exactly like something you''d see in a real advertisement.', '2006-10-06 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902430, 405867, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, straight-forward message with this well done (technically and visually) image.  Heck, even your title works!  :D  Hope it was still cold and tasty after you finished taking this photo!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, straight-forward message with this well done (technically and visually) image.  Heck, even your title works!  :D  Hope it was still cold and tasty after you finished taking this photo!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902439, 404017, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve put this together quite well.  Simple message.  The key element (beer bottle) is obviously the theme.  Composition and technicals are well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve put this together quite well.  Simple message.  The key element (beer bottle) is obviously the theme.  Composition and technicals are well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902450, 402728, 30049, '<td valign="top">This took a little effort to pull off I''d imagine.  ;^)  Sharp, well focused image with a easy to understand message.  Only question I have is did you consider having the incoming liquid be behind the can?  Perhaps that was tricky with getting good DOF...it''s just that a little bit of the illusion is lost seeing the entire splash - viewer can tell it''s coming from the right this way.  Anyway.  Very well done overall!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This took a little effort to pull off I''d imagine.  ;^)  Sharp, well focused image with a easy to understand message.  Only question I have is did you consider having the incoming liquid be behind the can?  Perhaps that was tricky with getting good DOF...it''s just that a little bit of the illusion is lost seeing the entire splash - viewer can tell it''s coming from the right this way.  Anyway.  Very well done overall!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 10:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902473, 404824, 16477, '<td valign="top">nice, Nice to  and Indian drink<br/>Best of Luck</td>', 'nice, Nice to  and Indian drinkBest of Luck', '2006-10-06 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902477, 405895, 16477, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2006-10-06 10:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
