(2902643, 405951, 51653, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but I think it is quite too commplex to be feasible in an advertisement.</td>', 'An interesting shot, but I think it is quite too commplex to be feasible in an advertisement.', '2006-10-06 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902650, 405725, 51653, '<td valign="top">This could be a good advertisement. An interesting shot and a lot of space to write the advertisement on the right. I''m just afraid of the strong light reflection on the can.</td>', 'This could be a good advertisement. An interesting shot and a lot of space to write the advertisement on the right. I''m just afraid of the strong light reflection on the can.', '2006-10-06 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902653, 405870, 51653, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I find the first one a little too big.</td>', 'I like it, but I find the first one a little too big.', '2006-10-06 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902661, 405328, 51653, '<td valign="top">Quite a common advertisement! It surely meets the challenge, and I like the realization but I think the light reflections are not well managed enough.</td>', 'Quite a common advertisement! It surely meets the challenge, and I like the realization but I think the light reflections are not well managed enough.', '2006-10-06 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902664, 405438, 46031, '<td valign="top">i really like the grainy background</td>', 'i really like the grainy background', '2006-10-06 11:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902667, 405321, 51653, '<td valign="top">The effect on the ice is really great and so are the colors. I find this shot really interesting and I wish you had managed to have a different table border because I find the straight line somewhat out of place.</td>', 'The effect on the ice is really great and so are the colors. I find this shot really interesting and I wish you had managed to have a different table border because I find the straight line somewhat out of place.', '2006-10-06 11:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902669, 406054, 51653, '<td valign="top">A good shot, I would probably preferred it with a less centered composition, but it works anyway</td>', 'A good shot, I would probably preferred it with a less centered composition, but it works anyway', '2006-10-06 11:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902671, 406055, 46031, '<td valign="top">i really like the perspective of this shot. would''ve liked it even better if the milk carton wasn''t there (i know why you put it in, i just think it would''ve worked better without it) and if the beer bottle looked... more like beer ;)</td>', 'i really like the perspective of this shot. would''ve liked it even better if the milk carton wasn''t there (i know why you put it in, i just think it would''ve worked better without it) and if the beer bottle looked... more like beer ;)', '2006-10-06 11:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902672, 405457, 51653, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the shot, but I find it is strongly damaged by the red frame. 6</td>', 'I definitely like the shot, but I find it is strongly damaged by the red frame. 6', '2006-10-06 11:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902688, 405871, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea that could work nicely as an ad. Maybe a "capture the taste" or "don''t let taste escape"Lighting seems a bit bright and the product could be displayed more prevelantly with a tighter crop.  Still very, very nice.</td>', 'Interesting idea that could work nicely as an ad. Maybe a "capture the taste" or "don''t let taste escape"Lighting seems a bit bright and the product could be displayed more prevelantly with a tighter crop.  Still very, very nice.', '2006-10-06 11:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902710, 405106, 33672, '<td valign="top">Classic job. I could easily place text above this and make a pretty nice ad.The lighting seems a bit dull but could probably be adjusted with the shadows/highlights adj in PS.</td>', 'Classic job. I could easily place text above this and make a pretty nice ad.The lighting seems a bit dull but could probably be adjusted with the shadows/highlights adj in PS.', '2006-10-06 11:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902771, 405920, 30049, '<td valign="top">Classy, clean, and making me thirsty!!!  :D  Well done.</td>', 'Classy, clean, and making me thirsty!!!  :D  Well done.', '2006-10-06 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902775, 405369, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Looks like an advertisement to me.  :D  Nicely done.</td>', 'Yep.  Looks like an advertisement to me.  :D  Nicely done.', '2006-10-06 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902782, 405281, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this image and I love the message.  It does seem that the coke can isn''t quite as sharp as the steering wheel - could be condensation on the can making it look soft?  Anyway, nice job overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this image and I love the message.  It does seem that the coke can isn''t quite as sharp as the steering wheel - could be condensation on the can making it look soft?  Anyway, nice job overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902795, 405003, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done with the background image.  The theme/message is very strong and well done.  Adding the peanuts is a great idea and adds nicely.  One minor complaint in the observation department...the white of the can is too warm (color temp) and isn''t quite white.  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done with the background image.  The theme/message is very strong and well done.  Adding the peanuts is a great idea and adds nicely.  One minor complaint in the observation department...the white of the can is too warm (color temp) and isn''t quite white.  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902801, 406055, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the POV.  Clever.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love the POV.  Clever.  Good luck.', '2006-10-06 11:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902806, 404976, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would have been really really cool if you could have either lined up the labels or removed the labels (lower ones) on the background bottles.  The seam where your background meets the glass is also a little distracting.  Clever concept and message.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This would have been really really cool if you could have either lined up the labels or removed the labels (lower ones) on the background bottles.  The seam where your background meets the glass is also a little distracting.  Clever concept and message.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 12:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902837, 405871, 36619, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand what is going on here, but i like this shot!</td>', 'i don''t understand what is going on here, but i like this shot!', '2006-10-06 12:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903265, 406058, 60036, '<td valign="top">Very phallic</td>', 'Very phallic', '2006-10-06 14:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903339, 404404, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  If that is really 7-Up, what a sticky mess.  :D  It''s a fun shot, I think the garage door background takes away from this.  A hilltop with blue sky behind him maybe?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yikes.  If that is really 7-Up, what a sticky mess.  :D  It''s a fun shot, I think the garage door background takes away from this.  A hilltop with blue sky behind him maybe?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903350, 403740, 30049, '<td valign="top">Funny concept.  A little more light could help this image.</td>', 'Funny concept.  A little more light could help this image.', '2006-10-06 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903359, 405921, 30049, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job putting this together overall compositionally.  The background seam in the lower left is an unfortunate distraction.  The image could stand to be rotated clockwise a little (couple degrees) - the coke bottle should be straight vertically.  Very close here.  Attention to the details can make or break an image sometimes, especially DPChallenge entries!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You did a nice job putting this together overall compositionally.  The background seam in the lower left is an unfortunate distraction.  The image could stand to be rotated clockwise a little (couple degrees) - the coke bottle should be straight vertically.  Very close here.  Attention to the details can make or break an image sometimes, especially DPChallenge entries!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 15:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903363, 405924, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Seems a bit out of focus. Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice idea. Seems a bit out of focus. Good lighting.', '2006-10-06 15:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903364, 403740, 60698, '<td valign="top">Good idea here. Seems a bit dark for a soft drink ad.</td>', 'Good idea here. Seems a bit dark for a soft drink ad.', '2006-10-06 15:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903374, 406001, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Hard to pull this off with straws the length as they are because they fall out of the focal plane (ends of the straws aren''t in focus).  A pair of scissors or a taller glass would have helped.  Your choice of subject positioning is good overall and the straws do create a nice slightly horizontal line lead-in to the glass.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Hard to pull this off with straws the length as they are because they fall out of the focal plane (ends of the straws aren''t in focus).  A pair of scissors or a taller glass would have helped.  Your choice of subject positioning is good overall and the straws do create a nice slightly horizontal line lead-in to the glass.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 15:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903426, 406054, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is really nice but it could be perfect with a few adjustments. A different crop so the bottle is not so centered. Cleaning your sensor before so there are no specks. Straighten your horizon.<br/> <br/>I love the colours and the idea.</td>', 'This is really nice but it could be perfect with a few adjustments. A different crop so the bottle is not so centered. Cleaning your sensor before so there are no specks. Straighten your horizon. I love the colours and the idea.', '2006-10-06 15:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903427, 405870, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, good setup</td>', 'Good DOF, good setup', '2006-10-06 15:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903428, 405895, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-10-06 15:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903429, 402852, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great job I really like this.</td>', 'Great job I really like this.', '2006-10-06 15:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903431, 405595, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and setup here.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and setup here.', '2006-10-06 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1);
