(2903668, 405176, 30049, '<td valign="top">This works well as an advertisement.  Comes across as cool and refreshing.  Put this on a billboard on a hot day and I''d be looking for one.  :D  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This works well as an advertisement.  Comes across as cool and refreshing.  Put this on a billboard on a hot day and I''d be looking for one.  :D  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903675, 405225, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about the color combination here that weakens the initial impact.  I think the yellow background is competing too strongly with the red for attention and the green is getting a back seat when the lime slice should be front and center.  Did you look at it with a white background, even a royal blue maybe?  Just a thought.  I like the way you''ve put this together.  The scale and layout is very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Something about the color combination here that weakens the initial impact.  I think the yellow background is competing too strongly with the red for attention and the green is getting a back seat when the lime slice should be front and center.  Did you look at it with a white background, even a royal blue maybe?  Just a thought.  I like the way you''ve put this together.  The scale and layout is very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903676, 405988, 30049, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out what''s in the background and I think it''s a substantial part of your message here based on your title.</td>', 'I can''t make out what''s in the background and I think it''s a substantial part of your message here based on your title.', '2006-10-06 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903680, 405425, 30049, '<td valign="top">Potential here.  Lighting is a little harsh on the left and the can doesn''t come across as being sharply focused (I think it''s the glare making the can look blurry/non-focused).  The drippy thing up top seems to be part of the story but I''m not sure what it is.  Is it related to the box in the back?</td>', 'Potential here.  Lighting is a little harsh on the left and the can doesn''t come across as being sharply focused (I think it''s the glare making the can look blurry/non-focused).  The drippy thing up top seems to be part of the story but I''m not sure what it is.  Is it related to the box in the back?', '2006-10-06 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903683, 404098, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, kinda.  I think you have too many props (ducks) with what should be the main subject.  The background was white?  If yes, a color temp adjustment needs to be made as it came out quite warm (yellow/red tones).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute, kinda.  I think you have too many props (ducks) with what should be the main subject.  The background was white?  If yes, a color temp adjustment needs to be made as it came out quite warm (yellow/red tones).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-06 16:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903716, 405774, 57378, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been my winning shot - Just a couple of things that make it miss that though.<br/>1. The tree stump competes far too much with the shape of the bottle<br/>2. The bottle should have been lit much better - My eye tends to go to the brightness of the sky.<br/>Great idea though</td>', 'I think this could have been my winning shot - Just a couple of things that make it miss that though.1. The tree stump competes far too much with the shape of the bottle2. The bottle should have been lit much better - My eye tends to go to the brightness of the sky.Great idea though', '2006-10-06 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903802, 406054, 61971, '<td valign="top">I must say this really looks like something from a Corona commercial. Great Job! The only thing I would have liked to see would be little higher crop on the sky. But seriously this was a WOW. 10</td>', 'I must say this really looks like something from a Corona commercial. Great Job! The only thing I would have liked to see would be little higher crop on the sky. But seriously this was a WOW. 10', '2006-10-06 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903886, 405281, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the colors and contrast are great.  I think your composition could be improved though.  It doesn''t seem like the coke can is the focal point of the image.</td>', 'I like the idea and the colors and contrast are great.  I think your composition could be improved though.  It doesn''t seem like the coke can is the focal point of the image.', '2006-10-06 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903900, 405595, 53316, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a tiiiiny bit unbalanced (eg there could be a bit more distinction on the bottle cap) (or maybe things look a bit unbalanced because of the slight asymmetry of the photo?), and the reflections in the bottom right of the image are a little distracting.  However.... besides these very minor things, I think this image is perfect (and I can''t bring myself to mark you down for any of these things!!)</td>', 'The lighting seems a tiiiiny bit unbalanced (eg there could be a bit more distinction on the bottle cap) (or maybe things look a bit unbalanced because of the slight asymmetry of the photo?), and the reflections in the bottom right of the image are a little distracting.  However.... besides these very minor things, I think this image is perfect (and I can''t bring myself to mark you down for any of these things!!)', '2006-10-06 18:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903906, 404388, 53316, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t think beer was disgusting, this photo would make me thirsty. :-) I love the way the liquid looks so in motion. Great job.</td>', 'If I didn''t think beer was disgusting, this photo would make me thirsty. :-) I love the way the liquid looks so in motion. Great job.', '2006-10-06 18:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903907, 403790, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aside from the unbalanced black at the bottom, I LOVE THIS.  I love the interesting textured feel of the background and the colors work great together.</td>', 'Aside from the unbalanced black at the bottom, I LOVE THIS.  I love the interesting textured feel of the background and the colors work great together.', '2006-10-06 18:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903909, 403259, 60495, '<td valign="top">The I wood cookie cracks me up, and what are the other cookies up to? DOF on the plate could be better but fun shot. 6</td>', 'The I wood cookie cracks me up, and what are the other cookies up to? DOF on the plate could be better but fun shot. 6', '2006-10-06 18:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903910, 406055, 53316, '<td valign="top">Haha, I love the contrast with the milk!  This is a great image (colors and composition I especially love) but it definitely could have been helped with a larger file size.  150K is the max, and it would have eliminated a lot of the boxy feel of the background and the hand.</td>', 'Haha, I love the contrast with the milk!  This is a great image (colors and composition I especially love) but it definitely could have been helped with a larger file size.  150K is the max, and it would have eliminated a lot of the boxy feel of the background and the hand.', '2006-10-06 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903914, 405737, 53316, '<td valign="top">Something about the colors or contrast strikes me as a little off... maybe needs a slight levels adjustment?  Not sure.  But honestly, this is a great image and I''m not marking down any for the bit of off-ness.</td>', 'Something about the colors or contrast strikes me as a little off... maybe needs a slight levels adjustment?  Not sure.  But honestly, this is a great image and I''m not marking down any for the bit of off-ness.', '2006-10-06 18:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903915, 404026, 60495, '<td valign="top">Really nice, skin tones and lighting on the boy are great, the down side is the bright spots and lighting on the bottle. I gave it a 6 but it would have gone up with a little better overall lighting.</td>', 'Really nice, skin tones and lighting on the boy are great, the down side is the bright spots and lighting on the bottle. I gave it a 6 but it would have gone up with a little better overall lighting.', '2006-10-06 18:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903917, 404812, 53316, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop, and using the maximum file size allowed (150K) may have helped.  I like the concept and the colors, and you definitely captured a great moment here!!</td>', 'A tighter crop, and using the maximum file size allowed (150K) may have helped.  I like the concept and the colors, and you definitely captured a great moment here!!', '2006-10-06 18:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903918, 405959, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, so my friend <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55558" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">peroty</a> showed me the Red Stripe ads on You Tube..... so I think your title is HILLARIOUS.  I think it also works if you haven''t seen the ads, since your shot really has the "iced tea is bad, beer is better" vibe.</td>', 'Oh my gosh, so my friend  peroty showed me the Red Stripe ads on You Tube..... so I think your title is HILLARIOUS.  I think it also works if you haven''t seen the ads, since your shot really has the "iced tea is bad, beer is better" vibe.', '2006-10-06 18:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903920, 405369, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great slogin - did you make it up?  I think the only thing that really is not that great is the black part at the bottom - it is kind of distracting.  Other than that I like it.</td>', 'Great slogin - did you make it up?  I think the only thing that really is not that great is the black part at the bottom - it is kind of distracting.  Other than that I like it.', '2006-10-06 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903925, 405988, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that''s a diet coke can... I think the image may have been better with a bigger depth of field so that viewers would not have to guess as much.  But I love the concept and composition.</td>', 'I''m assuming that''s a diet coke can... I think the image may have been better with a bigger depth of field so that viewers would not have to guess as much.  But I love the concept and composition.', '2006-10-06 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903940, 404639, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great image.... I just don''t think that the bottle is as prominant as it should be to really sell the product.  But hmm.  Maybe if it were in a magazine or something, it could have words on it to draw attention to the product....   Alright, I''m really struggling to decide, but I think I''ll have to take a point off, but only because I added the non prominance to the fact that the left leg is cropped off really awkwardly (both weren''t worth a deduction on their own).<br/> <br/>I really love the textures.. the background is great.. lots of detail but it''s not distracting.. same with the mud on the truck.  I love the lighting and contrast so much, and the model looks so natural (I especially like the hair) that she doesn''t seem to me like she is in the shot just to add sex appeal.  It seems tastefully done and kind of realistic.<br/> <br/>So the only things I really don''t like are the leg and the non prominance, and because the quality of the photo is so great I''m starting with a 10 and going from there, so you can figure out what I just gave you. :-)</td>', 'Wow, this is a great image.... I just don''t think that the bottle is as prominant as it should be to really sell the product.  But hmm.  Maybe if it were in a magazine or something, it could have words on it to draw attention to the product....   Alright, I''m really struggling to decide, but I think I''ll have to take a point off, but only because I added the non prominance to the fact that the left leg is cropped off really awkwardly (both weren''t worth a deduction on their own). I really love the textures.. the background is great.. lots of detail but it''s not distracting.. same with the mud on the truck.  I love the lighting and contrast so much, and the model looks so natural (I especially like the hair) that she doesn''t seem to me like she is in the shot just to add sex appeal.  It seems tastefully done and kind of realistic. So the only things I really don''t like are the leg and the non prominance, and because the quality of the photo is so great I''m starting with a 10 and going from there, so you can figure out what I just gave you. :-)', '2006-10-06 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903942, 405886, 53316, '<td valign="top">Neat concept.</td>', 'Neat concept.', '2006-10-06 19:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903943, 404795, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, nice.  The dark colors are great together.</td>', 'Ooooh, nice.  The dark colors are great together.', '2006-10-06 19:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903949, 406054, 53316, '<td valign="top">... Oh dear.  I feel badly for the other Corona entries.  I think I like one I''ve seen better than this one, maybe? (I am not a huge fan of your border, and I think the lighting was maybe too harsh. (But overall this really is a good shot.) ) But this just has such a WOW factor for anyone who has seen the Corona ads with the beach.  I have to hand it to you for a wonderful concept.</td>', '... Oh dear.  I feel badly for the other Corona entries.  I think I like one I''ve seen better than this one, maybe? (I am not a huge fan of your border, and I think the lighting was maybe too harsh. (But overall this really is a good shot.) ) But this just has such a WOW factor for anyone who has seen the Corona ads with the beach.  I have to hand it to you for a wonderful concept.', '2006-10-06 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903964, 403870, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and all but......Usually they want to see the product in the ad. Perhaps there was a cooler filled with it nearby? Original take but not effective.</td>', 'Nice comp and all but......Usually they want to see the product in the ad. Perhaps there was a cooler filled with it nearby? Original take but not effective.', '2006-10-06 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903969, 405986, 33672, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop may have serve this better to display the miller logo more Prominently. If they could''ve turned it on it would''ve been much better. Nice comp and colors.</td>', 'A tighter crop may have serve this better to display the miller logo more Prominently. If they could''ve turned it on it would''ve been much better. Nice comp and colors.', '2006-10-06 19:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903971, 403864, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great job. Nice dof, lighting and sharpness.  Comp serves well but could be improved if it were a bit less centered. (Would allow more creativity with text placement.)</td>', 'Great job. Nice dof, lighting and sharpness.  Comp serves well but could be improved if it were a bit less centered. (Would allow more creativity with text placement.)', '2006-10-06 19:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903972, 402728, 4919, '<td valign="top">great picture.. perfect ad pic.. 10</td>', 'great picture.. perfect ad pic.. 10', '2006-10-06 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903983, 405281, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for a complete advertising campaign. Comp would work better with a tighter crop to display product more Prominently. The interior of the car is a bit dark. Nice job overall, very creative.</td>', 'Nice concept for a complete advertising campaign. Comp would work better with a tighter crop to display product more Prominently. The interior of the car is a bit dark. Nice job overall, very creative.', '2006-10-06 19:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903991, 404404, 33672, '<td valign="top">The wet shirt detracts as he''s definitely missing his target. A tighter crop would display product more prominently.  Not a bad idea and probabaly fun to shoot.</td>', 'The wet shirt detracts as he''s definitely missing his target. A tighter crop would display product more prominently.  Not a bad idea and probabaly fun to shoot.', '2006-10-06 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904007, 405328, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great, great idea. (Makes me want to go out and buy a becks right now) Great attention to detail. Fill flash might''ve taken away the only distraction I see: the bottle''s shadow and a coulple of blown highlights on the foil and cap. Otherwise my favorite example so far in this theme:)</td>', 'Great, great idea. (Makes me want to go out and buy a becks right now) Great attention to detail. Fill flash might''ve taken away the only distraction I see: the bottle''s shadow and a coulple of blown highlights on the foil and cap. Otherwise my favorite example so far in this theme:)', '2006-10-06 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904246, 403740, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great concept and Idea of the importance of the product.  Funny too. The lighting is a bit dark but the comp would work well with text placement.</td>', 'Great concept and Idea of the importance of the product.  Funny too. The lighting is a bit dark but the comp would work well with text placement.', '2006-10-06 21:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904253, 405703, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and idea. This would work well with added text and for the purpose of brand reinforcement. The label should be more prominent. The added effect isn''t exactly clear.</td>', 'Nice comp and idea. This would work well with added text and for the purpose of brand reinforcement. The label should be more prominent. The added effect isn''t exactly clear.', '2006-10-06 21:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904257, 405514, 33672, '<td valign="top">Strange crop. I''d had liked to see the whole bottle. Concept is very funny and has potential. Lighting and shadows work well with concept.</td>', 'Strange crop. I''d had liked to see the whole bottle. Concept is very funny and has potential. Lighting and shadows work well with concept.', '2006-10-06 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904267, 405225, 33672, '<td valign="top">I really like this albiet I''d like to see it sharper The divisions between the sections and interesting comp lends itself to creative text placement. Very nice overall concept.</td>', 'I really like this albiet I''d like to see it sharper The divisions between the sections and interesting comp lends itself to creative text placement. Very nice overall concept.', '2006-10-06 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904278, 405827, 33672, '<td valign="top">Cool effects. I''d like to see a levels adjustment to give it more "pop". Comp is perfect and displays product well. Very nice concept and overall presentation.</td>', 'Cool effects. I''d like to see a levels adjustment to give it more "pop". Comp is perfect and displays product well. Very nice concept and overall presentation.', '2006-10-06 21:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904287, 403790, 33672, '<td valign="top">This id one of the set up photos that doesn''t really need text to be a great ad. I''m sure of whats being sold and it''s very well displayed. Only distraction is the bottle should really be alot sharper so it stands out more.</td>', 'This id one of the set up photos that doesn''t really need text to be a great ad. I''m sure of whats being sold and it''s very well displayed. Only distraction is the bottle should really be alot sharper so it stands out more.', '2006-10-06 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904328, 404586, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like ads like this. Nice concept with your product. As a photo I believe this needs a levels adj and bit less harsh light. As an ad it needs a tighter crop to display what your selling better.</td>', 'I like ads like this. Nice concept with your product. As a photo I believe this needs a levels adj and bit less harsh light. As an ad it needs a tighter crop to display what your selling better.', '2006-10-06 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904338, 405003, 33672, '<td valign="top">Excellent ad! Nice DOF and great presentation of product. Nice attention to detail with the condensation on the can.</td>', 'Excellent ad! Nice DOF and great presentation of product. Nice attention to detail with the condensation on the can.', '2006-10-06 21:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904360, 405196, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and you''re on the right track as far comp goes. The comp here lends itself well to creative text placement. I''d use either a tighter or wider crop. One that would show the whole bottle or one that focuses more on the label. I like the bronze shadow.8</td>', 'Nice lighting and you''re on the right track as far comp goes. The comp here lends itself well to creative text placement. I''d use either a tighter or wider crop. One that would show the whole bottle or one that focuses more on the label. I like the bronze shadow.8', '2006-10-06 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904369, 406059, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighitng is interesting but I wonder if it highlights the product enough. I''d definitely use a beer with less foam. Background color would work well with text.</td>', 'Lighitng is interesting but I wonder if it highlights the product enough. I''d definitely use a beer with less foam. Background color would work well with text.', '2006-10-06 21:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904399, 403067, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, concept and the way the dof isolates what you''re selling. The bottle for some reason, doesn''t look frosty. This is one of the photos that really doesn''t need text to be an ad. Very nice.</td>', 'I like the idea, concept and the way the dof isolates what you''re selling. The bottle for some reason, doesn''t look frosty. This is one of the photos that really doesn''t need text to be an ad. Very nice.', '2006-10-06 21:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904407, 405652, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and lighting. Text would fit well in this.  Umbrellas add a tropical feel but....The beverage doesn''t look appetizing. Perhaps you could''ve blended it bit more. Great start.</td>', 'I like the comp and lighting. Text would fit well in this.  Umbrellas add a tropical feel but....The beverage doesn''t look appetizing. Perhaps you could''ve blended it bit more. Great start.', '2006-10-06 22:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
