(2905403, 405426, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting idea for a macro. frozen?  Not so sure I love the overall composition and wonder how you went about choosing it. I find the bottom half of your image very soothing to look at, while the top is a brawl of bubbles...perhaps this contrast was your intent</td>', 'interesting idea for a macro. frozen?  Not so sure I love the overall composition and wonder how you went about choosing it. I find the bottom half of your image very soothing to look at, while the top is a brawl of bubbles...perhaps this contrast was your intent', '2006-10-07 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905407, 405174, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like this. The sunglasses are a effective prop. This needs to a bit sharper to display the product properly (I should be able to see the details in the lime) A less centered comp would be a bit more interesting and lend itself to creative text placement.</td>', 'I like this. The sunglasses are a effective prop. This needs to a bit sharper to display the product properly (I should be able to see the details in the lime) A less centered comp would be a bit more interesting and lend itself to creative text placement.', '2006-10-07 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905411, 405768, 33672, '<td valign="top">Scary ;)  Nice presentation of product. Highlights detract a bit. DOF is nice and I can see a bit of condensation that should be more pronounced to make product more attractive.</td>', 'Scary ;)  Nice presentation of product. Highlights detract a bit. DOF is nice and I can see a bit of condensation that should be more pronounced to make product more attractive.', '2006-10-07 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905414, 404103, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like your idea of having the fade off effect at the bottom, very cool.  second thing that came to mind was how interesting would it have been to have the bottle pouring straight on to keep a very weird symmetricalness to the image, to enchance the odd lighting</td>', 'i really like your idea of having the fade off effect at the bottom, very cool.  second thing that came to mind was how interesting would it have been to have the bottle pouring straight on to keep a very weird symmetricalness to the image, to enchance the odd lighting', '2006-10-07 11:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905418, 404812, 33672, '<td valign="top">Funny idea! I can see a logo for sangria underneath this with your catch line in bold text above it. This might also work for a Don''t drink and drive campaign. Photo overall is nice. A less centered comp and a little more sharpness would improve this immensely.</td>', 'Funny idea! I can see a logo for sangria underneath this with your catch line in bold text above it. This might also work for a Don''t drink and drive campaign. Photo overall is nice. A less centered comp and a little more sharpness would improve this immensely.', '2006-10-07 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905427, 405000, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like "testimonial shots like this. product is well displayed and model looks like she has enjoyed this product. Too bad she isn''t looking at the camera for a better effect. A tighter crop would help in two ways. It would eliminate the distracting lamp and present the product more prominently.</td>', 'I like "testimonial shots like this. product is well displayed and model looks like she has enjoyed this product. Too bad she isn''t looking at the camera for a better effect. A tighter crop would help in two ways. It would eliminate the distracting lamp and present the product more prominently.', '2006-10-07 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905432, 405900, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation and idea to appeal to a specified demographic. Highlights are a bit blown and the background is a bit cluttered and unfortunately the "Dirty" equipment is what jumps out at me first A tighter crop and clean sneakers would really improve this.</td>', 'Nice presentation and idea to appeal to a specified demographic. Highlights are a bit blown and the background is a bit cluttered and unfortunately the "Dirty" equipment is what jumps out at me first A tighter crop and clean sneakers would really improve this.', '2006-10-07 11:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905440, 405725, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp, very interesting and serviceable for text placement. Nice product presentation. The only thing is the lighting a bit more diffusion on the flash would''ve really helped this but a nice overall job.</td>', 'Great comp, very interesting and serviceable for text placement. Nice product presentation. The only thing is the lighting a bit more diffusion on the flash would''ve really helped this but a nice overall job.', '2006-10-07 11:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905442, 405609, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice, lighting and DOF. Text could be easily and creatively placed and product presentation is excellent. Focus could be a bit sharper and some condensation on the glass would help your tag line.</td>', 'Nice, lighting and DOF. Text could be easily and creatively placed and product presentation is excellent. Focus could be a bit sharper and some condensation on the glass would help your tag line.', '2006-10-07 11:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905446, 403112, 33672, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the executives at Keystone would say but I laughed. This seems more suited for an idea for a tv spot Lighting is a bit harsh and the background detracts a bit.</td>', 'I don''t know what the executives at Keystone would say but I laughed. This seems more suited for an idea for a tv spot Lighting is a bit harsh and the background detracts a bit.', '2006-10-07 11:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905454, 405438, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp, focus, lighting and DOF. Funny idea. Animals with products they don''t consume are always intersting and fun. Nice presentation of product. The composition allows room for text.</td>', 'Great comp, focus, lighting and DOF. Funny idea. Animals with products they don''t consume are always intersting and fun. Nice presentation of product. The composition allows room for text.', '2006-10-07 11:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905458, 406054, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I love carona''s commercials and this could be a still shot from one of them. Great choice of local for your shoot. Comp alllows for east text placement but I''d like to see a tighter crop for two reasons; you could present the product more prominently and it could adjust the comp to be a bit more off centered to make it a bit more interesting.</td>', 'Great idea! I love carona''s commercials and this could be a still shot from one of them. Great choice of local for your shoot. Comp alllows for east text placement but I''d like to see a tighter crop for two reasons; you could present the product more prominently and it could adjust the comp to be a bit more off centered to make it a bit more interesting.', '2006-10-07 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905462, 405988, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp, presentation, DOF and focus. I like the play on their ad campaign. Comp lends itself well to text placement and presentation is very attractive.</td>', 'Great comp, presentation, DOF and focus. I like the play on their ad campaign. Comp lends itself well to text placement and presentation is very attractive.', '2006-10-07 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905469, 404974, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love bass ale and this is a very nicely set up still life that is befitting their reputation (at least here in the US) Product presentation is a little dark and the label would be better if it were facing us directly. DOF would work better if it were more shallow and background is busy and distracting.</td>', 'I love bass ale and this is a very nicely set up still life that is befitting their reputation (at least here in the US) Product presentation is a little dark and the label would be better if it were facing us directly. DOF would work better if it were more shallow and background is busy and distracting.', '2006-10-07 11:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905473, 404699, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and presentation as well as DOF that focus on the product. I always like contrast ads like this. Only detractions are reflection on the pepsi can and too tight crop that doesn''t leave room for text. Still very nice. 8</td>', 'Nice lighting and presentation as well as DOF that focus on the product. I always like contrast ads like this. Only detractions are reflection on the pepsi can and too tight crop that doesn''t leave room for text. Still very nice. 8', '2006-10-07 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905481, 404812, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the photo does not pull it off as well as the concept needs.</td>', 'Great idea but the photo does not pull it off as well as the concept needs.', '2006-10-07 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905489, 405584, 33672, '<td valign="top">This could be the poster boy for the trouble with basic editing with an advertising theme at DPC.  Great job! A selective desat would help present the product more prominently. But a brightly colored logo and text placed in the negative space would work really well too. (Very nice comp)  I do like the rythm effect here but the lead can should be sharper. 7</td>', 'This could be the poster boy for the trouble with basic editing with an advertising theme at DPC.  Great job! A selective desat would help present the product more prominently. But a brightly colored logo and text placed in the negative space would work really well too. (Very nice comp)  I do like the rythm effect here but the lead can should be sharper. 7', '2006-10-07 11:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905502, 405126, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea but photo seems set up in front of another photo. You do send the message that this is refreshing.  Comp is nice but product should be presented more prominently (especially the entire label.) Existing comp lends itself well to text usage. And background is beautiful even if it is a photo.</td>', 'Great idea but photo seems set up in front of another photo. You do send the message that this is refreshing.  Comp is nice but product should be presented more prominently (especially the entire label.) Existing comp lends itself well to text usage. And background is beautiful even if it is a photo.', '2006-10-07 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905513, 404976, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and catchy tag line. Lighting seems a bit harsh but product presentaton is excellent. A little more room on the right would help with text placement. Very nice job overall though.</td>', 'Nice idea and catchy tag line. Lighting seems a bit harsh but product presentaton is excellent. A little more room on the right would help with text placement. Very nice job overall though.', '2006-10-07 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905533, 404902, 33672, '<td valign="top">Original idea that needs a more prominent presentation of product.  This is just a bit too subtle. Nice lighting and focus.</td>', 'Original idea that needs a more prominent presentation of product.  This is just a bit too subtle. Nice lighting and focus.', '2006-10-07 12:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905547, 404026, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and comp. Lighing on product (though well presented)is a bit harsh. Nice negative space on top lends itself well to text placement. I also like how the model is looking at the camera.  Tag line is original but then there should be a reference to soccer somewhere in the photo.</td>', 'Nice DOF and comp. Lighing on product (though well presented)is a bit harsh. Nice negative space on top lends itself well to text placement. I also like how the model is looking at the camera.  Tag line is original but then there should be a reference to soccer somewhere in the photo.', '2006-10-07 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905565, 404381, 33672, '<td valign="top">NIce effect with the rain. The only thing is a dark background withbrown bottles doesn''t let the product "pop" out at you. Comp is nice and allows for text. Seems a bit over saturated but bright colors do attract attention.</td>', 'NIce effect with the rain. The only thing is a dark background withbrown bottles doesn''t let the product "pop" out at you. Comp is nice and allows for text. Seems a bit over saturated but bright colors do attract attention.', '2006-10-07 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905573, 404388, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like shots like this. They remind me of billboard ads. Afew blown highlights distract from the product that is nicely presented. Negative space works well for text, but focus needs to be sharper.</td>', 'I like shots like this. They remind me of billboard ads. Afew blown highlights distract from the product that is nicely presented. Negative space works well for text, but focus needs to be sharper.', '2006-10-07 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
