(2905696, 402535, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems like a lot to look at and the beer bottle isn''t providing that much impact.  What might have been cool is to come in a little tighter, move the bottle to the right some, and get more of the people in the background in the water and on the beach.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Seems like a lot to look at and the beer bottle isn''t providing that much impact.  What might have been cool is to come in a little tighter, move the bottle to the right some, and get more of the people in the background in the water and on the beach.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-07 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905738, 405368, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly sends an ''Orange'' message.  Clean, well focusued and overall appealing.  Trying to figure out the distortion on the top right of the can.  It looks like the can is under two separate layers of water.  I''ll have to revisit after the challenge...hopefully you''ve told a little bit about how this was done.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Certainly sends an ''Orange'' message.  Clean, well focusued and overall appealing.  Trying to figure out the distortion on the top right of the can.  It looks like the can is under two separate layers of water.  I''ll have to revisit after the challenge...hopefully you''ve told a little bit about how this was done.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-07 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905742, 405755, 30049, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this will get the most comments award for the challenge?  :D  A clever take on the challenge and an interesting image to look at as well.  I think what makes it work (besides being clever) is the use of foreground and background subjects to tie it together visually for the viewer.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I wonder if this will get the most comments award for the challenge?  :D  A clever take on the challenge and an interesting image to look at as well.  I think what makes it work (besides being clever) is the use of foreground and background subjects to tie it together visually for the viewer.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-07 13:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905748, 405783, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, the frosty glass.  :D  Making me thirsty!  I like the way the light works in this image with the glow coming across the coins on the table.  Nice job on composing this.  Many would be tempted to include all of the money on the table but I think it works better as you''ve done it.  Good choice of aperture to slightly blur out the background.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh, the frosty glass.  :D  Making me thirsty!  I like the way the light works in this image with the glow coming across the coins on the table.  Nice job on composing this.  Many would be tempted to include all of the money on the table but I think it works better as you''ve done it.  Good choice of aperture to slightly blur out the background.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-07 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
