(2912664, 402852, 52500, '<td valign="top">I love the "splash" of color!  Ha, I made a pun!  Very well done, looks great.</td>', 'I love the "splash" of color!  Ha, I made a pun!  Very well done, looks great.', '2006-10-09 21:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
