(2912785, 405737, 60770, '<td valign="top">HA! Great picture, the soft tones came out really well. A highlight on the Heineken would really set it off though, the picture''s a little dark.</td>', 'HA! Great picture, the soft tones came out really well. A highlight on the Heineken would really set it off though, the picture''s a little dark.', '2006-10-09 22:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
