(2914065, 404812, 60343, '<td valign="top">Confirmation of the old photo maxim: when it''s weird, shoot it straight and when it''s straight, shoot it weird. Won''t be many/any others like this.</td>', 'Confirmation of the old photo maxim: when it''s weird, shoot it straight and when it''s straight, shoot it weird. Won''t be many/any others like this.', '2006-10-10 11:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914066, 403740, 60343, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Needs some supplemental lighting.</td>', 'Too dark. Needs some supplemental lighting.', '2006-10-10 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914074, 403808, 60343, '<td valign="top">Very clever concept and fine execution. Limited pallette is very effective.</td>', 'Very clever concept and fine execution. Limited pallette is very effective.', '2006-10-10 12:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914080, 405420, 66515, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and well executed. I really like the starfield in the background. Its too bad the person making the O wasn''t really looking anywhere.</td>', 'Very cool idea and well executed. I really like the starfield in the background. Its too bad the person making the O wasn''t really looking anywhere.', '2006-10-10 12:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914094, 405818, 60343, '<td valign="top">Standard,  space-efficient bar card composition. The brew needs back or sub light to make it pop from dark bacground. Try gold foil strip strategically placed behind glass and bottle or cut hole in base material (towell?) and fire light up from underneath. Add salt to increase/maintain head during shoot. Good start.</td>', 'Standard,  space-efficient bar card composition. The brew needs back or sub light to make it pop from dark bacground. Try gold foil strip strategically placed behind glass and bottle or cut hole in base material (towell?) and fire light up from underneath. Add salt to increase/maintain head during shoot. Good start.', '2006-10-10 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914107, 406061, 60343, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition. Deft lighting touch (feathered spot?) Not sure the monochromatic pallette is best choice. Wonder what this would have looked like with color counterpoint</td>', 'Great angle and composition. Deft lighting touch (feathered spot?) Not sure the monochromatic pallette is best choice. Wonder what this would have looked like with color counterpoint', '2006-10-10 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914114, 402852, 60343, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Great composition. Says "refreshing." Makes me want one which is just what a good product image is supposed to do. Eye goes straight for red soda well-placed in corner of frame. Why clear (empty?) on the back bottle?</td>', 'Very effective. Great composition. Says "refreshing." Makes me want one which is just what a good product image is supposed to do. Eye goes straight for red soda well-placed in corner of frame. Why clear (empty?) on the back bottle?', '2006-10-10 12:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914124, 405886, 60343, '<td valign="top">Effective change-of-pace background for beer image. More cerebral, less brawny. Strong photojournalistic "found" quality. Beer bottle has its own space in a strong composition. Effective limited focus. Fine informal product shot.</td>', 'Effective change-of-pace background for beer image. More cerebral, less brawny. Strong photojournalistic "found" quality. Beer bottle has its own space in a strong composition. Effective limited focus. Fine informal product shot.', '2006-10-10 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914158, 405901, 60343, '<td valign="top">Good, strong bar card image with upscale brand the star of the show rather than the stuff inside, per advertisers'' familiar strategy of targeting affluent demographic. Neutral background keeps eye on beautiful green package.This is a "buy." Well done.</td>', 'Good, strong bar card image with upscale brand the star of the show rather than the stuff inside, per advertisers'' familiar strategy of targeting affluent demographic. Neutral background keeps eye on beautiful green package.This is a "buy." Well done.', '2006-10-10 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914161, 403000, 60343, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Cool effects playing on "light."</td>', 'Very clever. Cool effects playing on "light."', '2006-10-10 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914178, 404484, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely job of "freezing" the scene at the moment of explosion, but the colours are too muted and lack any kind of "pop".</td>', 'Lovely job of "freezing" the scene at the moment of explosion, but the colours are too muted and lack any kind of "pop".', '2006-10-10 12:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914182, 405870, 60343, '<td valign="top">Stout brand statement complements product name by projecting strength through primary colors of labels and shoulder-to-shoulder composition. Lit just right, strong but not over-the-top. Advertisers love this sort of image. I want one.</td>', 'Stout brand statement complements product name by projecting strength through primary colors of labels and shoulder-to-shoulder composition. Lit just right, strong but not over-the-top. Advertisers love this sort of image. I want one.', '2006-10-10 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914187, 405420, 60343, '<td valign="top">Cool but where''s the actual coke ( or empty coke in keeping with the caption)? Nice timing. This is a real production.<br/>Thank you.</td>', 'Cool but where''s the actual coke ( or empty coke in keeping with the caption)? Nice timing. This is a real production.Thank you.', '2006-10-10 12:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914206, 404795, 60343, '<td valign="top">Knockout pairing, perfect color pallette. I can hear it now: "You have lovely hair and skin. It reminds me of Guinness." Fine touch with lighting. Every choice on target. Why go on? Perfect. Congratulations.</td>', 'Knockout pairing, perfect color pallette. I can hear it now: "You have lovely hair and skin. It reminds me of Guinness." Fine touch with lighting. Every choice on target. Why go on? Perfect. Congratulations.', '2006-10-10 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914215, 404788, 60343, '<td valign="top">So simple but so outstanding. Very pretty, very clever. Takes you right to the brand. A real eyecatcher.</td>', 'So simple but so outstanding. Very pretty, very clever. Takes you right to the brand. A real eyecatcher.', '2006-10-10 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914305, 402813, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent, best on show!</td>', 'excellent, best on show!', '2006-10-10 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914337, 405457, 64434, '<td valign="top">lol, funny once you realize it,might be hard for some people to get though</td>', 'lol, funny once you realize it,might be hard for some people to get though', '2006-10-10 14:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914342, 405425, 64434, '<td valign="top">it seems like there''s almost too much in this photo and it takes away from the main focus.</td>', 'it seems like there''s almost too much in this photo and it takes away from the main focus.', '2006-10-10 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914346, 405901, 64434, '<td valign="top">no offense but its not very creative</td>', 'no offense but its not very creative', '2006-10-10 14:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914352, 403163, 64434, '<td valign="top">cool idea, but it makes me want to stand farter away from the pepsi, in case i might incur its wrath, POW!!</td>', 'cool idea, but it makes me want to stand farter away from the pepsi, in case i might incur its wrath, POW!!', '2006-10-10 14:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914353, 405924, 64434, '<td valign="top">the focus is on the tile</td>', 'the focus is on the tile', '2006-10-10 14:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914363, 405886, 64446, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve captured the atmosphere there. The 2 bottles direct to the black man, whose expression can be see, even oof. Nice DOF. Great job!</td>', 'I think you''ve captured the atmosphere there. The 2 bottles direct to the black man, whose expression can be see, even oof. Nice DOF. Great job!', '2006-10-10 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914364, 403864, 64446, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant! Nice DOF and color contrast betweeen the beer and .the bg</td>', 'Simple and elegant! Nice DOF and color contrast betweeen the beer and .the bg', '2006-10-10 14:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914463, 405420, 40106, '<td valign="top">WOWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/>WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/>WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/>WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/>WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/>WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW<br/> <br/>ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon<br/> <br/>:) i like it<br/><br/><i>Message edited by alanfreed - Huge string of Ws breaking page length....</i></td>', 'WOWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbonribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon ribbon :) i like itMessage edited by alanfreed - Huge string of Ws breaking page length....', '2006-10-10 15:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914470, 402728, 53952, '<td valign="top">Why is there coke under the opening?<br/>Great idea, nice execution, good picture.</td>', 'Why is there coke under the opening?Great idea, nice execution, good picture.', '2006-10-10 15:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914694, 405607, 66751, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting.</td>', 'Great use of lighting.', '2006-10-10 16:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914703, 405871, 66751, '<td valign="top">The reflective surface enhanced the image.</td>', 'The reflective surface enhanced the image.', '2006-10-10 16:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914707, 406032, 66751, '<td valign="top">Great play on words.</td>', 'Great play on words.', '2006-10-10 16:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914710, 404381, 66751, '<td valign="top">The movement of the rain is great.</td>', 'The movement of the rain is great.', '2006-10-10 16:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914713, 405827, 66751, '<td valign="top">Love the fog.</td>', 'Love the fog.', '2006-10-10 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914718, 405328, 66751, '<td valign="top">Sold! Where do I buy?</td>', 'Sold! Where do I buy?', '2006-10-10 16:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914725, 405895, 66751, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the bottle glow, great job.</td>', 'The lighting makes the bottle glow, great job.', '2006-10-10 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914734, 405774, 66751, '<td valign="top">A little too much backlighting makes the bottle hard to read. Great idea though.</td>', 'A little too much backlighting makes the bottle hard to read. Great idea though.', '2006-10-10 16:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914737, 402813, 66751, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.</td>', 'Great contrast.', '2006-10-10 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914742, 406061, 66751, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting.</td>', 'Great use of lighting.', '2006-10-10 17:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914746, 405986, 66751, '<td valign="top">Love the rustic look.</td>', 'Love the rustic look.', '2006-10-10 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914754, 405648, 66751, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field.</td>', 'Good use of depth of field.', '2006-10-10 17:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914761, 405867, 66751, '<td valign="top">its almost mistical. i love it.</td>', 'its almost mistical. i love it.', '2006-10-10 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914984, 405870, 66341, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of colours and perspective, and just the right amount of condensation.<br/>There''s something about the front two bottles that makes me feel a bit queasy, though, like they''re tipping forwards or to the left or something. Perhaps the image is cropped off-centre from an original that had strong tapering parallels.</td>', 'I like the choice of colours and perspective, and just the right amount of condensation.There''s something about the front two bottles that makes me feel a bit queasy, though, like they''re tipping forwards or to the left or something. Perhaps the image is cropped off-centre from an original that had strong tapering parallels.', '2006-10-10 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914995, 404017, 66341, '<td valign="top">Great colours and lighting. The subject seems a little too much to the left for me. Maybe the horse head should be 1/3 across. The hand pose looks a little uncomfortable as if the bottle is deliberately being held to show the label.</td>', 'Great colours and lighting. The subject seems a little too much to the left for me. Maybe the horse head should be 1/3 across. The hand pose looks a little uncomfortable as if the bottle is deliberately being held to show the label.', '2006-10-10 18:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915010, 405191, 66341, '<td valign="top">I like the way everything works together to give an impression of, oo, I dunno, 1960s? Table, chair, tiles, glasses, hair. I like the contrast. The man seems out of focus. There are several jpeg artefacts from making the picture too compressed, especially around the elbow, glass and table edge. The vertical lines are not vertical.</td>', 'I like the way everything works together to give an impression of, oo, I dunno, 1960s? Table, chair, tiles, glasses, hair. I like the contrast. The man seems out of focus. There are several jpeg artefacts from making the picture too compressed, especially around the elbow, glass and table edge. The vertical lines are not vertical.', '2006-10-10 18:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915017, 405774, 66341, '<td valign="top">Colourful, bold composition. And funny. I have one compositional comment - the hand posture is not at all natural for someone lying in a bath - it looks like the bottle is being held for the photo, possibly even with the wrong hand. I would expect a hand to wrap around more. And a niggle - there''s some jpeg noise on the feet.</td>', 'Colourful, bold composition. And funny. I have one compositional comment - the hand posture is not at all natural for someone lying in a bath - it looks like the bottle is being held for the photo, possibly even with the wrong hand. I would expect a hand to wrap around more. And a niggle - there''s some jpeg noise on the feet.', '2006-10-10 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915024, 404812, 66341, '<td valign="top">For me, this is not advertising a drink. In my opinion this also gets close to a photo of (moving) art, rather than an arty photo. Fine line, and I''m sure others will disagree.</td>', 'For me, this is not advertising a drink. In my opinion this also gets close to a photo of (moving) art, rather than an arty photo. Fine line, and I''m sure others will disagree.', '2006-10-10 18:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915026, 403000, 66341, '<td valign="top">that''s a nice play on words. Well lit &amp; black background.</td>', 'that''s a nice play on words. Well lit & black background.', '2006-10-10 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915034, 405584, 66341, '<td valign="top">nice perspective line. I like the horizontal texturing. It''s a shame the front and rear cans are not both in focus, but you can''t have everything.</td>', 'nice perspective line. I like the horizontal texturing. It''s a shame the front and rear cans are not both in focus, but you can''t have everything.', '2006-10-10 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915037, 405106, 66341, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting &amp; colours &amp; black background, but WAY too much "sky". Try cutting most of the top off the picture for a wide aspect ratio</td>', 'Nice lighting & colours & black background, but WAY too much "sky". Try cutting most of the top off the picture for a wide aspect ratio', '2006-10-10 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915043, 405949, 66341, '<td valign="top">There''s not enough happening in the picture for me. I can see the table tapering off was to add lines, but they''re at the wrong angle and sort of lead my eye away from the can instead of to it. Maybe it would help if I could see the lines running to the base of the can?</td>', 'There''s not enough happening in the picture for me. I can see the table tapering off was to add lines, but they''re at the wrong angle and sort of lead my eye away from the can instead of to it. Maybe it would help if I could see the lines running to the base of the can?', '2006-10-10 18:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915046, 405703, 66341, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours and mood. I''m afraid I cannot recognise the brand of drink, so it cannot advertise it to me.</td>', 'Really nice colours and mood. I''m afraid I cannot recognise the brand of drink, so it cannot advertise it to me.', '2006-10-10 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915050, 405920, 66341, '<td valign="top">Oo. Nice proportions, match of bottle to glass, framing, lighting, condensation, branding. Niggle - there''s a white streak at the top right of the photo.</td>', 'Oo. Nice proportions, match of bottle to glass, framing, lighting, condensation, branding. Niggle - there''s a white streak at the top right of the photo.', '2006-10-10 18:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915053, 406058, 66341, '<td valign="top">That''s funny. visual plays on words always (well, often) make me smile. Nice lighting. Nice contrasty colours. For me, the bottle should be central or 1/3 across, not just a little off centre. Makes it look a bit like you missed</td>', 'That''s funny. visual plays on words always (well, often) make me smile. Nice lighting. Nice contrasty colours. For me, the bottle should be central or 1/3 across, not just a little off centre. Makes it look a bit like you missed', '2006-10-10 18:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915064, 404098, 66341, '<td valign="top">This is a picture of ducks, not of cider. I keep trying to look at the bottle, but keep getting distracted by the ducks. My eye tends to go to the top left of the picture (where the bottle is pointing), then generally follow the ducks down the left of the shot (they are sort of looking down the shot) to the ducks at the front looking at me, then I stop. I think all the ducks should look AT the bottle.</td>', 'This is a picture of ducks, not of cider. I keep trying to look at the bottle, but keep getting distracted by the ducks. My eye tends to go to the top left of the picture (where the bottle is pointing), then generally follow the ducks down the left of the shot (they are sort of looking down the shot) to the ducks at the front looking at me, then I stop. I think all the ducks should look AT the bottle.', '2006-10-10 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915069, 405369, 66341, '<td valign="top">Nicely proportioned composition. Shape of the glass offsets the shape of the bottle nicely, and the fruit balances it. And everything is so CLEAN. How long did you polish it all?</td>', 'Nicely proportioned composition. Shape of the glass offsets the shape of the bottle nicely, and the fruit balances it. And everything is so CLEAN. How long did you polish it all?', '2006-10-10 18:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915074, 406013, 66341, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the drink is - so it does not advertise it to me. Try turning the bottle being drunk so I can see the label.</td>', 'I don''t know what the drink is - so it does not advertise it to me. Try turning the bottle being drunk so I can see the label.', '2006-10-10 18:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915082, 404404, 66341, '<td valign="top">Funny. Nice action shot. Caught the moment well. I think there''s too much white on the left, and that horizontal line at elbow height isn''t horizontal. I know it''s a photography no-no, bu I wonder if some direct sunlight on the subject would add to the moment of being cooled off?</td>', 'Funny. Nice action shot. Caught the moment well. I think there''s too much white on the left, and that horizontal line at elbow height isn''t horizontal. I know it''s a photography no-no, bu I wonder if some direct sunlight on the subject would add to the moment of being cooled off?', '2006-10-10 18:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915090, 403740, 66341, '<td valign="top">The picture looks too static. The can (or at least the hands) needs to be thrust forth from the pool.</td>', 'The picture looks too static. The can (or at least the hands) needs to be thrust forth from the pool.', '2006-10-10 18:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915096, 405003, 66341, '<td valign="top">The can colours &amp; background colours match really well. Nicely proportioned picture. Background is nicely out of focus but everyone can see what it is. And most importantly, I can imagine having a beer and some nuts whilst watching an event on TV, so this really has advertised to me.</td>', 'The can colours & background colours match really well. Nicely proportioned picture. Background is nicely out of focus but everyone can see what it is. And most importantly, I can imagine having a beer and some nuts whilst watching an event on TV, so this really has advertised to me.', '2006-10-10 19:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915108, 405889, 66341, '<td valign="top">So perfect except for the colour hue. Oh, here''s a tongue-in-cheek niggle - the light source for the can and for the planet are from two different directions. tee hee. Great one!</td>', 'So perfect except for the colour hue. Oh, here''s a tongue-in-cheek niggle - the light source for the can and for the planet are from two different directions. tee hee. Great one!', '2006-10-10 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915114, 405607, 66341, '<td valign="top">The picture is perfect in every way, except it is dead. There''s no life. Perhaps some condensation would have propped it up. Or a reflection.</td>', 'The picture is perfect in every way, except it is dead. There''s no life. Perhaps some condensation would have propped it up. Or a reflection.', '2006-10-10 19:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915117, 402813, 66341, '<td valign="top">Funny, and probably harder to compose than it looks. There are a few specks on the left of the table that are distracting.</td>', 'Funny, and probably harder to compose than it looks. There are a few specks on the left of the table that are distracting.', '2006-10-10 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915129, 406032, 66341, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the liquid and the mouth differ too much, so it jumps out as photo-trickery. Less obvious, but maybe it looks odd because the light sources seem a different direction for each half of the picture</td>', 'The sharpness of the liquid and the mouth differ too much, so it jumps out as photo-trickery. Less obvious, but maybe it looks odd because the light sources seem a different direction for each half of the picture', '2006-10-10 19:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915137, 405725, 66341, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The can has no distinct outline which works well. The lighting highlight is harsh, though.</td>', 'I like this one. The can has no distinct outline which works well. The lighting highlight is harsh, though.', '2006-10-10 19:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915145, 405827, 66515, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect with the mist/fog. Did you use dry ice or anything to create the effect? I like the water drops on the can. It would be nice if the can was a shade sharper.</td>', 'Very cool effect with the mist/fog. Did you use dry ice or anything to create the effect? I like the water drops on the can. It would be nice if the can was a shade sharper.', '2006-10-10 19:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915148, 402535, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the setup on this picture. It would be nice if you got in a bit tighter to really enhance the bottle as the focal point in the picture. The ocean background is a really nice touch.</td>', 'I like the setup on this picture. It would be nice if you got in a bit tighter to really enhance the bottle as the focal point in the picture. The ocean background is a really nice touch.', '2006-10-10 19:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915156, 404824, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting caption to go with this picture. I like the sharpness and the white background. The pop fizzing over is a really nice touch. Very well done.</td>', 'Interesting caption to go with this picture. I like the sharpness and the white background. The pop fizzing over is a really nice touch. Very well done.', '2006-10-10 19:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915157, 404639, 47921, '<td valign="top">Works 4 me . . .</td>', 'Works 4 me . . .', '2006-10-10 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2915159, 405895, 66515, '<td valign="top">Very interesting setup. I like how the bottle floats in the air. Nice lighting in this shot.</td>', 'Very interesting setup. I like how the bottle floats in the air. Nice lighting in this shot.', '2006-10-10 19:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915161, 405959, 66515, '<td valign="top">Humourous composition. Nice use of a limited depth of field. Just out of curiousity, how did you get the bottle inside the can?</td>', 'Humourous composition. Nice use of a limited depth of field. Just out of curiousity, how did you get the bottle inside the can?', '2006-10-10 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915166, 405986, 66515, '<td valign="top">While maybe not great as an advertisement this picture is highly effective. I like the subtle humor you created by the title of the picture and the sign in the window. The vivid colors draw your eye around the shot forcing the viewer to explore the photograph.</td>', 'While maybe not great as an advertisement this picture is highly effective. I like the subtle humor you created by the title of the picture and the sign in the window. The vivid colors draw your eye around the shot forcing the viewer to explore the photograph.', '2006-10-10 19:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915180, 405003, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The focus is great and the way you''ve framed the picture it makes you feel like you are actually at the game.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The focus is great and the way you''ve framed the picture it makes you feel like you are actually at the game.', '2006-10-10 19:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915183, 403411, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lighting here. It would be nice if there was just a touch of fill flash to light up the label on the front of the bottle. Still very effective.</td>', 'Interesting use of lighting here. It would be nice if there was just a touch of fill flash to light up the label on the front of the bottle. Still very effective.', '2006-10-10 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915184, 405003, 62807, '<td valign="top">REALLY GREAT ARRANGEMENT! LOVE THE DOF. BRIGHT AND INTERESTING! 10!!</td>', 'REALLY GREAT ARRANGEMENT! LOVE THE DOF. BRIGHT AND INTERESTING! 10!!', '2006-10-10 19:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915187, 406052, 66515, '<td valign="top">This shot is quite compelling. The colors and the shapes of the bubbles really draw you in. The title really ties is all together. Well done!</td>', 'This shot is quite compelling. The colors and the shapes of the bubbles really draw you in. The title really ties is all together. Well done!', '2006-10-10 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
