(2915793, 403740, 59564, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you took the shot from.  It makes the can look really big.  Actually, now that I look for a second I think the can is really big in the first place :)  I really like the idea and it makes for an interesting shot.  I would like to see a little more light on the can though.  With the water in the background so bright it takes my attention away from the can which for an ad would be bad.</td>', 'I like the angle that you took the shot from.  It makes the can look really big.  Actually, now that I look for a second I think the can is really big in the first place :)  I really like the idea and it makes for an interesting shot.  I would like to see a little more light on the can though.  With the water in the background so bright it takes my attention away from the can which for an ad would be bad.', '2006-10-10 23:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915798, 405920, 59564, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I like your lighting choice from the side.  The slight shadow on the front of the bottle is the only thing that I would change.  Great job!</td>', 'very nice.  I like your lighting choice from the side.  The slight shadow on the front of the bottle is the only thing that I would change.  Great job!', '2006-10-10 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
