(2915812, 402535, 59564, '<td valign="top">Nice :)  The photo seems a bit bright to me.  I like how the railing and the pier in the background provide lines to lead me to the bottle.</td>', 'Nice :)  The photo seems a bit bright to me.  I like how the railing and the pier in the background provide lines to lead me to the bottle.', '2006-10-10 23:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915816, 405703, 59564, '<td valign="top">I like how you placed the mug and the bottle .  I''m not sure what the cloth (?) down the center and around the bottle is though.  It kind of takes my attention away from the bottle which for an ad is probably not good.</td>', 'I like how you placed the mug and the bottle .  I''m not sure what the cloth (?) down the center and around the bottle is though.  It kind of takes my attention away from the bottle which for an ad is probably not good.', '2006-10-10 23:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915822, 402429, 59564, '<td valign="top">This looks familiar.  Great dof and looks pretty close to an ad I would see in a magazine.</td>', 'This looks familiar.  Great dof and looks pretty close to an ad I would see in a magazine.', '2006-10-10 23:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915828, 406052, 59564, '<td valign="top">I dig it.  I think the circles up top are bubbles which is cool.  I don''t know that this could serve as an ad on it''s own but with some text and a logo I think it would be good.</td>', 'I dig it.  I think the circles up top are bubbles which is cool.  I don''t know that this could serve as an ad on it''s own but with some text and a logo I think it would be good.', '2006-10-10 23:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915838, 403126, 59564, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the dof.  It is enough to not distract from the Zlatorog but not so much that you can''t tell that can in the back is a Heineken.  The reflections are a bit distracting but overall nice job!</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the dof.  It is enough to not distract from the Zlatorog but not so much that you can''t tell that can in the back is a Heineken.  The reflections are a bit distracting but overall nice job!', '2006-10-10 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915841, 406013, 59564, '<td valign="top">The composition on this is wonderful.  Having the arm and hand in the picture makes my eyes always return back to the guys drink.</td>', 'The composition on this is wonderful.  Having the arm and hand in the picture makes my eyes always return back to the guys drink.', '2006-10-10 23:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915893, 405988, 59564, '<td valign="top">This would be such a great ad. The only thing not working for me is the dof.  It is so shallow that even by the time you get to the P in Pepsi you have already lost focus.  It also makes it hard to tell what is in the background without looking at the title and doing a bit of thinking.  At first look I thought it was a crumpled scarf and a candy cane.  I think if it was increased just a small amount it would add a lot to the image. But the more I sit on this image the more I think that maybe that was your intention.  Maybe by making the viewer look longer at the image and think more about it you are accomplishing what most ads cannot...holding the viewers attention.  Ok, now I''m just rambling.  I''m not taking anything off of my vote for the dof because I''ve talked myself into a state of un-decidedness on it.  Great photo 7.</td>', 'This would be such a great ad. The only thing not working for me is the dof.  It is so shallow that even by the time you get to the P in Pepsi you have already lost focus.  It also makes it hard to tell what is in the background without looking at the title and doing a bit of thinking.  At first look I thought it was a crumpled scarf and a candy cane.  I think if it was increased just a small amount it would add a lot to the image. But the more I sit on this image the more I think that maybe that was your intention.  Maybe by making the viewer look longer at the image and think more about it you are accomplishing what most ads cannot...holding the viewers attention.  Ok, now I''m just rambling.  I''m not taking anything off of my vote for the dof because I''ve talked myself into a state of un-decidedness on it.  Great photo 7.', '2006-10-10 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2915894, 405595, 59564, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is excellent as is the title.</td>', 'The lighting on this is excellent as is the title.', '2006-10-10 23:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
