(2916733, 404639, 47487, '<td valign="top">just wanted to say that I find the comments about the goofiness of the jeans to be hilarious. I still think low-rise jeans look like they''re firmly planted in the wrong decade -- not to mention that only a very small minority of the girls who wear them look truly good in them. "Mom jeans" -- well, I guess that''s accurate, because I, a mom, think they''re way better than the stupid low-rise ones you see on all these girls today whether they have the figure for them or not (though, to be fair, this girl seems to).<br/> <br/>Plus, it looks like they''re Wranglers, and if they are, that fits the redneck-going-playing-in-the-mud image to an absolute T. Any country girl knows that the right pair of Wranglers will get all the Stetsons in the vicinity pointed in her direction.<br/> <br/>As far as the photo itself -- I think you''ve done better, Leroy, but if you''re going for a TV-beer-commercial kind of look you''re not too far off. Really, though, from you I''d expected something a little slicker and more carefully done.</td>', 'just wanted to say that I find the comments about the goofiness of the jeans to be hilarious. I still think low-rise jeans look like they''re firmly planted in the wrong decade -- not to mention that only a very small minority of the girls who wear them look truly good in them. "Mom jeans" -- well, I guess that''s accurate, because I, a mom, think they''re way better than the stupid low-rise ones you see on all these girls today whether they have the figure for them or not (though, to be fair, this girl seems to). Plus, it looks like they''re Wranglers, and if they are, that fits the redneck-going-playing-in-the-mud image to an absolute T. Any country girl knows that the right pair of Wranglers will get all the Stetsons in the vicinity pointed in her direction. As far as the photo itself -- I think you''ve done better, Leroy, but if you''re going for a TV-beer-commercial kind of look you''re not too far off. Really, though, from you I''d expected something a little slicker and more carefully done.', '2006-10-11 02:43:06.000000', NULL, 0),
