(2917018, 404639, 41337, '<td valign="top">Geez. 51 votes of &gt; 3 is insane. No other way to explain it. It''s a freak''n Beer challenge. What did people expect?</td>', 'Geez. 51 votes of > 3 is insane. No other way to explain it. It''s a freak''n Beer challenge. What did people expect?', '2006-10-11 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2917024, 404976, 63888, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the positive comments and praises.<br/> <br/>I agree, the light is a bit harsh but I like the clarity.<br/> <br/>glad2badad, I agree, I wanted to remove the labels but I had little time! Also don''t like the glass line in the background.<br/> <br/>Next time I will not use a wide angle to eliminate the distortion.<br/> <br/>And rswank, I agree, it is boring! Thought afterwards that some ice and maybe condensation on the bottle would have been nice and maybe some other lighting effects. Or some dry ice smoke . . Anyway, next time.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks all for the positive comments and praises. I agree, the light is a bit harsh but I like the clarity. glad2badad, I agree, I wanted to remove the labels but I had little time! Also don''t like the glass line in the background. Next time I will not use a wide angle to eliminate the distortion. And rswank, I agree, it is boring! Thought afterwards that some ice and maybe condensation on the bottle would have been nice and maybe some other lighting effects. Or some dry ice smoke . . Anyway, next time. ', '2006-10-11 05:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2917031, 405786, 63888, '<td valign="top">Well done man! This was my top shot for the challenge, glad it ribboned! Scary friend ;)</td>', 'Well done man! This was my top shot for the challenge, glad it ribboned! Scary friend ;)', '2006-10-11 05:48:47.000000', NULL, 0),
