(2917264, 403808, 66201, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone: this was a first attempt at being "studioesque". By that I mean..actually making an effort to set up or stage a photo. I hung the white sheet over the lemon tree, and then positioned the bottle against the sun ...and then crawled inside to take the shot. The lemon tree survived the ordeal! Very happy with the results.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-13 12:11:13.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone: this was a first attempt at being "studioesque". By that I mean..actually making an effort to set up or stage a photo. I hung the white sheet over the lemon tree, and then positioned the bottle against the sun ...and then crawled inside to take the shot. The lemon tree survived the ordeal! Very happy with the results.', '2006-10-11 09:10:36.000000', '2006-10-13 13:11:13.000000', 0),
