(2917545, 405986, 59200, '<td valign="top">Didn''t post during challenge, but I just had to say this was one of my favorites and am sad to see it as low as it is. I thought not having an actual can/glass/drink in the picture was very refreshing! Also, the composition, colors, and concept really appealed to me.</td>', 'Didn''t post during challenge, but I just had to say this was one of my favorites and am sad to see it as low as it is. I thought not having an actual can/glass/drink in the picture was very refreshing! Also, the composition, colors, and concept really appealed to me.', '2006-10-11 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2917594, 405777, 64175, '<td valign="top">I may be missing something here.  It is a very nice shot, but does it meet the challenge?   I mean the title says something about soda, but there is no picture of soda nor beer.  If it was a Whiskey add, it would be great. But in no way does it sell me a soft drink or beer (per challenge).<br/> <br/>"Use your creativity and your photographic skills to <b>sell a beer or soft drink </b>to the voters."</td>', 'I may be missing something here.  It is a very nice shot, but does it meet the challenge?   I mean the title says something about soda, but there is no picture of soda nor beer.  If it was a Whiskey add, it would be great. But in no way does it sell me a soft drink or beer (per challenge). "Use your creativity and your photographic skills to sell a beer or soft drink to the voters."', '2006-10-11 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2917624, 404788, 64175, '<td valign="top">You got robbed.  No less than a #5 entry.  Personally, comparatively speaking, this was ribbon material.  <br/> <br/>Voters!, what are you going to do with them. ;)</td>', 'You got robbed.  No less than a #5 entry.  Personally, comparatively speaking, this was ribbon material.   Voters!, what are you going to do with them. ;)', '2006-10-11 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
