(2918769, 404484, 19672, '<td valign="top">Since gatorade has no alcohol I consider a soft drink.<br/> <br/>That said, in a moment of humor I put the nice german boch back in the fridge and grabbed a Woodchuck Cider (as woodchuck rhymed with rubber duck) and into the composition it went.<br/> <br/>I know at least one "1" and likely the others were for failing to meet the challenge by having an alcoholic drink.</td>', 'Since gatorade has no alcohol I consider a soft drink. That said, in a moment of humor I put the nice german boch back in the fridge and grabbed a Woodchuck Cider (as woodchuck rhymed with rubber duck) and into the composition it went. I know at least one "1" and likely the others were for failing to meet the challenge by having an alcoholic drink.', '2006-10-11 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
