(2920040, 406054, 16230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon Daniel! It''s a wonderful photo and well deserving of a ribbon.<br/> <br/>It''s curious that lots of people mentioned the sensor spots, which is a very minor problem and easily fixed, but nobody mentioned the unevenly polarized sky, which often happens when you use a polarizing filter with a wide angle lens.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon Daniel! It''s a wonderful photo and well deserving of a ribbon. It''s curious that lots of people mentioned the sensor spots, which is a very minor problem and easily fixed, but nobody mentioned the unevenly polarized sky, which often happens when you use a polarizing filter with a wide angle lens.', '2006-10-11 19:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
