(2924970, 405867, 34192, '<td valign="top">There''s no way this is your first ribbon.  Seriously.  Well, DPC is what it is.  Congrats! And Blue no less.  Woohoo!  Its been a long time coming and you deserve it.  Should have had one a long time ago.  This isn''t your best image nor is it my favorite but it is the best and most perfect for the challenge and I''m glad everyone saw that.  Congrats again!</td>', 'There''s no way this is your first ribbon.  Seriously.  Well, DPC is what it is.  Congrats! And Blue no less.  Woohoo!  Its been a long time coming and you deserve it.  Should have had one a long time ago.  This isn''t your best image nor is it my favorite but it is the best and most perfect for the challenge and I''m glad everyone saw that.  Congrats again!', '2006-10-13 07:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
