(2926445, 402740, 55822, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this and I do like it for a beer ad. However this speaks to me on a more personal level. This shot reminds me of my father who used to ride with one of the last posse''s in the US. The guy looks a little like my dad and the horse looks like our horse "Boo". This shot just gives me a sense of peace. Thanks.<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'I see where you were going with this and I do like it for a beer ad. However this speaks to me on a more personal level. This shot reminds me of my father who used to ride with one of the last posse''s in the US. The guy looks a little like my dad and the horse looks like our horse "Boo". This shot just gives me a sense of peace. Thanks. Chris', '2006-10-13 17:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
