(2938241, 404098, 14476, '<td valign="top">I suppose, The Saj, you are posting this to "prove a point" but as long as you have posted it, I''ll give you my opinion of the image:<br/> <br/>Just as I feel strongly that cigarette companies should not advertise their products along with "candy-flavored cigarettes" or stuffed animals like "Joe Camels", so do I also believe that adult beverages should not be surrounded by kids toys.  <br/> <br/>If I''m wrong, and the beverage is not hard cider containing alcohol, than I apologize for the post.</td>', 'I suppose, The Saj, you are posting this to "prove a point" but as long as you have posted it, I''ll give you my opinion of the image: Just as I feel strongly that cigarette companies should not advertise their products along with "candy-flavored cigarettes" or stuffed animals like "Joe Camels", so do I also believe that adult beverages should not be surrounded by kids toys.   If I''m wrong, and the beverage is not hard cider containing alcohol, than I apologize for the post.', '2006-10-18 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
